<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Kukomb</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kukomboka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu su Kukomboka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu sa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kukomboka mihilu</para>
  <para style="imt">Kukomboka</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu su kukomboka mihilu ndi kibii makelubuki gi mihilu jejuje jilandi mwiitabu yengi yimihilu nkati ji itabu nhwanu yukutumbuli mu Lilaganu la Mwandi. Lihina likitabu senze Kiebulania libii na maana jenze, “Malobi.” Mundu jojuandiki kitabu senze jubonikana ndi Musa hata ngati pa mwisu palandi kuwa kwaki. Kitabu senze kitumbuli kulonge malobi gagapwaga, “Ganga ndi malobi gaguge Musa jaapwagila Aizalaeli.” Kuholale kubanga Musa ndi jojuandiki kitabu senze su Kukomboka Mihilu na kubonikana kabee mala jengi mu itabu Lilaganu Linyai. Linga lilenganu lende mu kitabu sa Mahengu ga Atenga 3:22-23 Pandu pajuandi Peti jaandika lilobi kuhuma mu kitabu sukukomboka Mihilu 18:15-18 nukulogo kubanga haga gabiya malobi gaka Musa. Kuwesikana Musa ndi jojaandiki kitabu sukukomboka mihilu pamu ni kitabu sukutumbuli ni kitabu su Kuboka ni kitabu sa Alawi ni kitabu sukubalanga mu yaka elupu jimu na mia nsesi au elupu jimu na mia tatu kabula jukusaliwa Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu sukukomboka mihilu saandikwa ngati majetanga kati jaka bambu nkolongu nu ubambu nkolongu gongi gogubii pai juulongosi waki, ngati hekwahengika pa mwandi. Ndi majetanganu kati jaka Sapanga na bandu buku Izilaeli. Sapanga jwajetaki kwaapenge bandu ana bombi bakajetakia nukujipwata miilu jaki. Ngati ana Bandu buku Izilaeli baka jikaniki miilu jaka Sapanaga, ndienu bakatenda kwaalapu. Lende ndi lijambu likolongu likitabu senze; lakini lipungu la 27 na 28 lilongale ngani kupete kupata mbenge na yaambamba yeyakapatikana kupete kujetake au kunga'anambuka kwa bandu buku Izilaeli. Makabila ndalindali ga bandu buku Izilaeli bajema mu itombi yeilingalani, nukupwagani mbenge hei na yaambamba hei ibii ngati indela jukulangi lilaganu heli kubanga atei kulijeke.</para>
  <para style="io">Gagabii nkati</para>
  <para style="iot">Musa jukombuke gagapitii mu sapwali jukujenda ku Izilaeli kulomboka kulungwenza linga mulipungu 1 mbaka la 3.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kilandi mihilu ji lilagi kati ja Sapanga na bandu linga mulipungu la 4 mbaka 25.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndienu mu lipungu la 27 mbaka 30 bandu buku Izilaeli alogo mbenge na yambamba kwa sauti ngolongu kulangi kuhuma kipindi lilaganu litei kujetakeka.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mwisu weni Musa julonge malobi ga mwisu kwaka Joshua, na kulikabila la Aizilaeli kabula ja kuwa kwaki mulipungu la 31 mbaka 34.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Kitabu senze kibi na malobi gaguge Musa jwaapwagila bandu boti buku Izilaeli pababi kulungweza upandi golipita lyoba wa losi lwa Yoludani. Babia kuligomba la Yoludani pambipi na pandu pabapakema sufu mu musi uku Palani upandi gumu wa musi uku Tofeli na wa musi uku Labani na musi uku Hazeloti na musi uku Dizahabu nu upandi gongi. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Kuhika hoku guujenda masoba komi na moja kuhumi ku musi uku Holebu mbaka musi uku Kadeshi Balinea sukupete indela ji kitombi sa Seili. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Lisoba lu kutumbuli la mwei wa kumi na moja, saka sa alubaini baada jukuboka ku Misili, Musa jaapwagila bandu, kila sindu sesuse Bambu Sapanga jabia anndagalaki jaapwagila. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Jahenga hela pajabia anhwesiki bambu Sihoni jwa Aamoli jojutamika ku nndema uku Heshiboni na bambu Ogu juku Bashani jojutamika ku nndema uku Ashitaloti mu musi uku Edelei. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Musa jahenga lihengu la kwaalandi bandu mihilu jaka Sapanga pababia kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani upandi golipiti lyoba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 1:5">Jaapwagila ana, <verse eid="DEU 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“Patwabii kukitombi sa Sinai, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu jutupwagila ana, ‘Ntemi masoba gingi mu kitombi senze, <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />enu mmbombulana mahema ginu nu unhendalia na sapwali. Nnzendania mu milema ji itombi ja Aamoli na pandu pu nndema ja pambipi ku Alaba, mu itombi na magomba upandi ukusini na pandu ja pambwani, enaa, nzenania mbaka ku nndema uku Kanani nu nndema uku Lebanoni, mbaka ku losi lukolongu lola lobulukema Efulati. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Nepani Bambu Sapanga napwaaga, nndema gongo woti naapekiya akahoku binu Ibulaimu ni Isaka na Yakobu ni ibeleku yabu yoti. Nnzendania mkugujukua gubiya jinu.’”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa jaahagu bandu bukutemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Kuboka 18:13-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Musa jaapwagila bandu, “Patwabii twakona kukitombi sa Sinai, nepani numpwagila ana, ‘Nepani kajika jangu kunndongosa mwanganya mwaboti ndi lihengu lukolongu ngamaa. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, junhengiti mmbiya mwabingi, lelenu mmbii mwabingi ngati ndondu yukunani. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waka hoku binu, junhenga nhendalia kujonzukeka ngani kupeta embii sajenu nukumpenge ngati ejalagila! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Lakini nepani kajika jangu niiwesa bole kulihenga lihengu likolongu lukutemu magambu na matatisu gino? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Nhagula kuhuma mu kila likabila bandu baabi ni malangu na baamanyiki majambu na baajetakewa ili naahagula abiya akikilongosi binu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Mwanganya mwajetaki mwanyibua ana, ‘Lilobi legulongi laamboni’. <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Ndienu naajukua akikilongosi babi ni isima na baawesa kulonge saamboni na baajetakewa babube babia baasagwi kuhuma mu makabila ginu, nukwaahenga kuba akikilongosi binu. Bangi naahenga akuba akakilongosi ba makundi ga bandu elupu jimu na bangi abiya akikilongosi ba makundi ga bandu miamia na bangi abia akikilongosi bamakundi ga bandu amusiniamusini na bangi akikilongosi ba makundi ga bandu komikomi. Kabee naahagula akikilongosi bangi bakwaalongosa bandu ba kila likabila.<verse eid="DEU 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />“Kipindi hesi naalagalakia baatemu bii bala malagalaki ganga, ‘Nzowania magambu ga bandu binu. Mwaatemula sanga kupendalela magambu ga bandu binu Aizilaeli na magambu ga ageni baatama pamu na mwanganya. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Mwampendalee mundu jokapi pamwiibia ntenda kutemu, mwaajoania sanga kupendalela, akolongu kwa asoku. Mwanzogopa mundu jokapi ndaba kutemu komwiitemula kwiihuma kwaka Sapanga. Ligambu lokapi lelisindikana kwinu, mwalileta kwangu nepani, nanepani nalijowania.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Kipindi sehesi nundagalakia majambu goti gagapalika kuhenga.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aizalaeli akana lilagalaki lukujingi mu nndema</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Esabu 13:1-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />“Ndienu twahenga ngati, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, ejutulagalakia, twatumbulia sapwali jitu kukitombi sa Holebu, twapeta kulukoba lukolongu lukutisa lomulumanyi, sukupwata indela jejilongo ku nndema gwi itombi ya Aamoli. Patwahika ku musi wa Kadeshi Balinea, <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Nepani nu mpwagila, ‘Sajenu nhikiki mu nndema gwiitombi wa Aamoli jejuje Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu jutenda kutupekea. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Ndingalia, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nndema gojapwaaga jutenda kutupekea ndi golagola. Enu! Nzingala mukatama ngati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa akahoku binu ejupwagila. Mwiijogopa wala kuhola!’<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />“Lakini mwanganya mwaboa mwahikania pambipi na nepani numpwagila, tutuma bandu alongulia kugulaluki nndema, halapu akelabuka kutupwagi indela ja sapi jukupeta na misi jabu jibii boo.<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />“Lijambu heli labonikana la mboni kwangu nepani, naahagula bandu komi na ibeli, mundu jumu kuhuma kila likabila. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Bandu haba bajenda ku nndema wiitombi gola, bahika kuligomba la Eshikoli na kugulalukila. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Pababuja, butuletila matunda kidogu gu nndema hogu na butupwagila kubanga nndema hogu gojutupekee Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu ndi jaamboni ngani.<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />“Lakini mwanganya ngasemwajetaki lilagalaki laka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu sukukana kwinu kujenda ku nndema hogu. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Mwang'ong'otikia nepani mu mahema ginu mwapwaga, ‘Bambu Sapanga jutei kutusuki ndaba jutupiiki ku nndema ja Misili. Japala jutukolukiya kwa Aamoli, ili butukoma. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Ndaba jaki tujenda hoko koni tusokiki makili na tubii nu lujogopo? Butupwagi kubanga bandu ba hoku ndi alasu kupeta twepani, na misi jabu ndi mikolongu najejibi ni imatu lulasu loluhika kunani kumahundi. Kabee bapwaga kubanga baabona bandu akolongu bi kibeleku saka Anaki!’<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />“Lakini nepani numpwagila ana, ‘Mwaajogopa bandu haba.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jojuwe jutenda kundongulela, jombi mweni jwiikomana kwa ndaba jinu ngati ejahengila ku nndema wa Misili, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />nukulukoba ndi pandu pakolongu panga kuba na sindu sokapi ila pee nsangi kajika jaki kola kokukwe mwabona namuna ejuntotula nsapwali heji joti ngati atati ejuntoto mwanamundu mbaka mwahika pamba. <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Lakini pamu nukupwagi majambu haga goti, mwanganya ngasemuhobali Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />jojuwe jundonguli mwiindela nukuntaputi pandu pukusenga mahema ginu. Ikilu jundongulia kwa mwotu na muwi jundongulia ku lihundi, ili kundangi indela.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu Sapanga jaalapu Aizilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 14:20-45">Esabu 14:20-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />“Bambu Sapanga junzowania kung'ong'oteka kwinu, jabia ni inyela, jalapa sukupwaga, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />‘Kyee nga mundu hata jumu mu kibeleku senze sekibi nu ubaja, jojijingala mu nndema wa sapi gola gonundagila kwaapeke akahoku binu. <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Kalebu mwana waka Yefuni, ndi kanzika jaki jojijingala, nanepani nampekia nndema hogu pajijenda kugulaluki gubia waki jombi ni ibeleku yaki ndaba jubii jukuhobaleka ngani kwangu nepani.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Kwa ndaba jinu mwanganya Bambu Sapanga jandendila inyela nepani kabee, japwaaga, ‘Hata wa Musa ngawijingi mu nndema homu. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Lakini Joshua mwana waka Nuni, jojugujangati mbaka jujingi homu. Enu gungangamisa mwoju ndaba jombi ndi jaalongusa bandu Aizalaeli kugukamu nndema gubiya gwabu’. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jutupwagila twepani twaboa, ‘Bana bihaba banzogopa kubanga abaja binu baatenda kwaakamu, enaa babii asoku haba banga kukimanya sindu saamboni au kibaja, haba ndi babijingala mu nndema homu, nanepani naapekia bombi nndema hogu ubiya wabu. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Lakini mwanganya nng'anambuka nkelubuka kulukoba kulongo ku nhanga wa Shamu.’<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />“Ndienu mwanyibua, ‘Twepani tunhengi mahakau Bambu Sapanga, lakini enu twiijenda kukomana ngati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu ejutulagalakia’. Hela, ndi kila jumu wii jukujiandia kukomana ngondu, ndaba mwaholalia kubanga libia lihengu lelinonwipi lu kutukali nu kugukamu nndema hogu wi itombi. <verse eid="DEU 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />Najombi Bambu Sapanga jwambwagila, ‘Waakalia bandu haba biijenda kukomana ndaba nepani ngase mi pamu na bombi, lakini ana apiti abaja babu biitenda kwaawesa’. <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Ndienu, nepani napwagila hela, lakini mwanganya ngasemwanyoanile. Mwakana kupwata lilagalaki laka Bambu Sapanga, ndaba ji ing'omu inu, mwajingala mu nndema ji itombi heji. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Hapa Aamoli bababiya atama pandu pala piitombi bahelala kukomana ngati inzusi na kwaalapu ku Seili mbaka ku Holima. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Ndienu pamwakelabuka nu kunndele Bambu Sapanga, Lakini Bambu Sapanga ngase junzowanile wala kulingali.<verse eid="DEU 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaka yebabia ku lukoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />“Henu, mwahigalia ku musi uku Kadeshi kwi kipindi kilasu, mwatama hoku.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s">Yaka isokopi kulungwenza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />“Ndienu, twang'anambuka kujenda kulungwenza sukupete indela ju unhanga nkolongu wa Shamu, ngati Bambu Sapanga ejambwagila twayonguluta yonguluta pambipi ni kitombi sa Seili kwi kipindi kilasu. <verse eid="DEU 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga, jambwagila, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />‘Nnyongaliti kukipindi kilasu mu nndema gongo wi itombi, enu ng'anambuka nzenda upandi uku kasikazini. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Mbii pambipi kupeta pikilanda ju nndema wi itombi ya Seili, nndema wa alongu binu kibeleku saka Esau. Haba bantenda kunzogopa, lakini mwalihangaliya, <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />mwiikomana nabu ndaba ngana mpekee pandu pokapi pu nndema wabu. Nganampekee hata pandu pasokapi pukukanyata. Nndema hogu wa Seili naapekii bandu bi kibeleku saka Esau gubiya gwabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Anampaliki posu au masi kuhuma kwabu ndi kwiipalika mwiilomba kwa madini ga feza.’<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />“Ndienu, nkombuka namuna Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ejumpengi mu kila lihengu lenhengiki. Juntunza pamwabia nzenda jenda kulungweza lukolongu londo. Jubii pamu na mwanganya yaka yoti alubaini jenze na ngase junzimiki sindu sokapi.<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />“Ndienu twaendalia na sapwali jitu, twakotuka kupeta kwa alongu bitu, kibeleku saka Esau bababia atama ku nndema wa Seili, tujileka munyuma indela jela jukujenda ku ligomba la Yoludani na misi ja Elati na ku Esiongebeli. Ndienu twang'anambuka twapwata indela jejipeta kulukoba lwa Moabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Bambu Sapanga jwambwagila, ‘Waasumbua bandu buku Moabu, wala wiikomana nabu ndaba nganumpeke mwanganya pandu pokapi pu nndema wabu. Nndema uku Ali hogu naapeki bandu bikibeleku saka Loti gubia mali gabu.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />Pamwandi nndema hogu uku Ali akubika atama bandu bingi, babi na makili babakemika Aemi, babube babiii alasu ngati bandu babaakema Aanaki. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Ngati mimundo jejabi mikolongu ni milasu baakemika Anaki, bandu haba amanyikana ngati Alefai, lakini Amoabu baakemika Aemi. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Pamwandi Aholi atamika ku Seili, lakini bandu bikibeleku saka Esau baabenga nukwakoma tipitipi, ndienu beni batama hoku pandu hapa. Aizalaeli na bombi bahenga helahela mu nndema gola goguwe Bambu Sapanga jaapekia gubiya wabu.<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />“Bambu Sapanga jutupwagila, ‘Nzendania henu mukalobuka ka losi ka Zeledi’. Ndienu twalobuka ka losi ka Zeledi. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Yaka selasini na nani yabia ipetiki tumbuka patwaboka ku musi uku Kadeshi Balinea mbaka kuloboka ka losi ka Zeledi. Kipindi hesi kibeleku soti sa bandu babi na yaka yukuwesa kukomana sabiya kiwii kulengana na Bambu Sapanga ejaalapila. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Bambu Sapanga mweni jwaalapula nukwaakoma kumakambi, mbaka boti pabajomuka.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />“Ndienu, bandu haba boti baabii na yaka yukuwesa kukomana pababia akuiki, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />Bambu Sapanga jwambwagila, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />‘Lelenu nndombuka mpaka gwa Moabu kupete nndema wa Ali. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Mwiihikila mu nndema wa Aamoni. Mwaasumbu wala kukomana nabu ndaba nganampekee pandu punndema pokapi pi kibeleku sa Aamoni, pabiya pinu. Naapeki bandu bi kibeleku saka Loti nndema hogu gubia wabu.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Kabee nndema hogu wamanyikana ndi nndema wa mimundu milasu babaakema Alefai. Alefai atamika hoku pa mwandi, Aamoli baakemika haba liina la Aazamuzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Alefai haba babia bandu bingi, bana makili na alasu ngati aka Anaki. Lakini Bambu Sapanga jatenda kwaakoma pabahika Aamoli babube bagujukua nndema wabu nu kutama homu badala jabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Bambu Sapanga jahenga ahelahela kwa Aedomu bababiya kibeleku saka Esau, babube atamika mu nndema wi itombi yuku Edomu. Jwaakoma Aaholi, ili Aedomu agukamula nndema wabu nukutama hoko, kokuje mbaka lelenu bakona bakatama. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Aavi babia atama mu ijiji yi ligomba lu nhanga nkolongu wa Meditelaniani mbaka ku musi uku gaza. Ndienu bahika Akafutoli kuhuma ku kilwa suku Kileti baatenda kwaakoma na batama homu badala jabu.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />“Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jutulagalakia, ‘Enu ntumbulia sapwali nndobuka ligomba la Alinoni. Nepani nunzangatiya kunhwesa Sihoni, bambu nkolongu wa bandu buku Aamoli juku musi wa Heshiboni nu nndema waki. Mukugulapula nukutumbuli kutama homu. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Lelenu ndumbuli kwaahenga bandu boti bupunndema abia nulujogopu kwa ndaba jinu, biijowana majambu ginu na bombi biitenda kubagaja nukuhangajika.’<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aizalaeli bunhwesa bambu nkolongu Sihoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Esabu 21:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />“Ndienu, naatuma bandu kuhuma kulukoba luku Kedemoti ajenda kuka bambu nkolongu Sihoni juku nndema uku Heshiboni ni lijambu la amboni lelapwaga, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />‘Gutuleka tupeta mu nndema waku. Tugulagi twiipeta mwiindela sanga kung'anambuka upandi wamalele wala upandi wa mangega. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Posu na masi ga kunywa twiilomba kwaku. Setuloba pe utujetakia tupeta kwa magolu gitu mu nndema waku, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />mbaka tulombuka losi luku Yoludani nu kujingi munndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu jutei kutupeke. Ibeleku yaka Esau yeitama ku nndema uku Seili na Amoabu baatama ku nndema uku Ali butuleka tupeta munndema wabu.’<verse eid="DEU 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />“Lakini Sihoni, bambu nkolongu ju nndema uku Heshiboni, ngasejutujetaki tupeta mu nndema waki. Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, anhenga jubiya ni kimutu sekinonwipi na mwoju gogubi ni kibuli, ili tuwesa nukugujuku nndema waki goguwe tutama mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />“Bambu Sapanga jwambwagila, ‘Linga ndumbuli kumbeka bambu nkolongu Sihoni nu nndema waki gunhwesa, ntumbuliya kugujukuu nndema waki nukutama.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Ndienu Sihoni jwapita na bandu baki boti kukomana na twepani pambipi na musi uku Yahasa. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Najombi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, antenda kumpia, tunhwesa jombi na bana baki na bandu baki boti. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Tugukamula nukuhalabana misi jaki joti, twaakoma akanalomi na akambomba na bana, ngasetundei mundu jokapi mwomi. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Hindu yetwiikamwi ndi yabia mipugu na hindu yoti yetuiketania mu misi. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Kutumbuli ku musi uku Aloeli musi gowabi mu nkenga wi ligomba la Alinoni na musi gowabii nkati ji ligomba heli mbaka musi uku Gileadi, nga musi wokapi wogwabii nganganganga gotasindwa kugukamula. Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, jutuhenga tujiwesa misi heji. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Lakini ngasetwahegali mu nndema wa Aamoni au nkenga wa losi lwa Yaboki wala mu misi ju nndema jiitombi wala pandu pokapi pala papupe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, jatenda kutukanaki.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli bunhwesa bambu nkolongu Ogu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Esabu 21:31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />“Ndienu, twang'anambuka nu kukwela ku Bashani. Bambu nkolongu Ogu jwapita na bandu baki kukomana na twepani pambipi na musi uku Edelei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Lakini Bambu Sapanga jambwagila, ‘Wanzogopa ndaba nunzangatiya munhwesa pamu na bandu baki nu nndema waki. Wanhengila ngati egunhengila bambu nkolongu Sihoni jwa Aamoli jojutamika ku Heshiboni.’<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />“Hela ndi Bambu Sapanga eanzangatiya kunhwesa bambu nkolongu Ogu juku Bashani na bandu baki, twaakoma nga hata jumu jojahigalile. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Tujikamula misi jaki joti, nga hata musi gumu gotwasindwa kugukamula. Jumula twakamula misi sitini, misi jeheji jabiya ndi pandu poti pa Aligobu papuje julongusa bambu Ogu ju nndema uku Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Misi joti heji jabii nu lumatu lulasu, jabii na matanga ni mipengu jukupangaki. Kwabii kabee ni ijiji yingi yeyabii ngaseayongulati lumatu. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Twaakoma tipitipi kila sindu hoku, twahalabana kila musi na kwaakoma akanalomi na akambomba na bana ngati etwahenga mu misi jaka bambu nkolongu Sihoni ju nndema uku Heshiboni. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Lakini mipugu na hindu yoti twatenda kujukuu.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />“Kipindi hesi tugutola nndema hogu gowabia gulongoswa na aka bambu akolongu abeli ba Aamoli bababia atama kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani, pikilanda ja losi luku Alinoni ni kitombi sa Helimoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Asidoni bikikema kitombi sa Helumoni, Silioni na Aamoli bikikema kitombi hesi Senili. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Tujikamula misi joti ju puubamba ni lieneu loti luku Gileadi nu nndema uku Bashani mbaka ku Seleka nuku Edelei, misi jaka bambu nkolongu Ogu juku nndema uku Bashani.” <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />Bambu nkolongu Ogu ndi kajika jaki jojahigali kati ji mimundu mikolongu ni milasu jebijikemika Alefai. Kitanda saki sabia sikisoma soma ulasu waki futi komi ni ibeli nu upana waki futi sita, mbaka lelenu kitanda hesi sakoli kibii ku musi wa Aamoli ku Laba.<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila gagatama upandi golipiti lyoba wa Yoludani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Esabu 32:1-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Etugukamula nndema hogu, naapekia bandu ba makabila gaka Lubeni na Gadi kutumbuli lieneu lu upandi uku kasikazini juku Aloeli pambipi na losi luku Alinoni na nusu lieneu li itombi yuku Gileadi, pamu na misi jaki. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Ndienu nilipekia nusu likabila laka Manase lieneu lelahigalia ku Gileadi pamu nuku Bashani kojabia julongosa bambu nkolongu Ogu, lelule ndi lieneu loti lu nndema uku Aligobu. Nndema woti uku Bashani wamanyikana kubanga ndi ja bandu babaakema Alefai. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Yaili, mundu kuhuma mu likabila laka Manase, jwatola lieneu loti lu nndema wa Aligobu, jejuje ndi Bashani mbaka mu mpaka uku Geshuli na Maaka. Ijiji yoti jwiikema liina laki, mbaka lelenu ijiji heyi imanyikana kwi liina la Yaili. <verse eid="DEU 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Bandu bu lukolu lwaka Makili bi likabila la Manase naapekia nndema uku Gileadi, <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />na bandu ba makabila gaka Lubeni na Gadi naapekia nndema woti kuhumi ku Gileadi mbaka ku losi lwa Alinoni. Mpaka wabu ukusini wabiya pikilanda ja losi na gu upandi wa kasikazini wabiya losi lwa Yaboki goguwe wapakini nu nndema wa Aamoli. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Upandi golijingi lyoba nndema wabu waendali mbaka ku losi luku Yoludani, kuhumi ku nhanga uku Galilaya upandi uku kasikazini, wahelala mbaka ku nhanga uku Alaba, goguwe ndi nhanga wa mwinyu, mbaka mwiihele ya Pisiga, upandi golipita lyoba.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />“Kipindi sela naalagalakia ana, ‘Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jumpeki nndema gongo gu upandi golipiti lyoba wa losi luku Yoludani jibia jinu. Lakini kupalika akanalomi binu boti baawesa kukomana ngondu, koni biliandii kukomana, alombukakwii ja koni baalonguli alongu babu Aizilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Lakini akahanu binu na bana binu ni inyama yinu, ndaba manyiki mbii ni mipugu jingi, biihigalia mu nndema gonumpekii. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Mwaajangatia akalongu binu Aizalaeli mbaka Bambu Sapanga ejwajangatia kutuli pandu pabu ngati mwanganya entemi su lukwali na awesa kugukamu nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, junmpeki kwii ja losi luku Yoludani. Mwiiwesa kubujani mu nndema gonumpeki aje jibia jinu baada jakaajangati akalongu binu!’<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />“Ndienu nundagalakia Joshua, ‘Wehapa gulingiki kwa mihu gaku majambu goti gaguge Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, jwaahengi akabambu akolongu abeli babube ndi bambu nkolongu Sihoni na bambu nkolongu Ogu, jombi jwaahengila ahelahe akabambu akolongu boti bu nndema yemwiipeta. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Mwaajogopa ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino, ndi jojankomania mwanganya.’<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa ngajujingi ku Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />“Kipindi hesi nundobiki ngamaa Bambu Sapanga, napwaga, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />‘Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, manyiki gunangi nepani ntumisi waku ukolongu waku nu uwesu waku, ngakuba sapanga jongi jojubii kunani au punndema jojuwesa kuhenga majambu makolongu nu gukusangasa ngati eguhengiki wehapa. <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Nuguloba nandi, nobuka losi kuku Yoludani, nuguboni nndema wamboni hogu gogubii upandi wa golijingi lyoba kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani, ena nu nndema wamboni gogunyambikii gwiitombi pamu ni itombi ya Lebanoni.’<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />“Lakini Bambu Sapanga jahengila inyela nepani kwa ndaba jino, Badala jaki jambwagila, heli litosike! Wiipwaga kabee lijambu heli. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Gukwela mbaka kwikitombi sa Pisiga, ukalinga sapi upandi wa golijingi lyoba nu upandi uku kasikazini nu upandi ukusini nu upandi wa golipiti lyoba nukugubona nndema hogu, ila wehapa ngawiloboki losi lwa Yoludani londone. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Lakini gumpekia Joshua malagalaki, gungangamalisa mwoju, ndaba jombi ndi jojaalongua bandu haba mbaka kwii, kugukamu nndema gobagubona.<verse eid="DEU 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />“Henu ndi twahigalia piligomba la losi lwa Yoludani pambipi na musi uku Beti Peoli.”<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli apalika kupwata mihilu jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Musa jaendalia kulonge, “Enu mwiangalia nu kupwatali malagalaki goti ganumboliki, ili nhwesa kutama nukugujuku nndema hogu kuba gwinu, goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waka hoku binu, jutenda kumpeke. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Mwiijonzuke sokapi mu mihilu jenumpeke, wala mwipungusa sindu, mwajipwata mihilu jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jenumpeke. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Mwanganya mwalinga kwa mihu ginu majambu gajahenga Bambu Sapanga kukitombi sa Baali Peoli. Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jaakoma bandu boti pikilanda jinu babikigungamalia kisapanga Baali Peoli. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Lakini mwanganya mwemwabia mwenhobaleka kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, mbii mwa bomi mbaka lelenu.”<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />“Henu! Nunmboliki mihilu na malagalaki ngati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wangu, ejanagalakia henga, ili mwagapwata mu nndema gomwiijenda kujikamu na kuba winu. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Nkamula nukutimisa mihilu na malagalaki haga ndaba ananhengiki hela bandu banga Ayaudi. Ebijowana mihilu heji biimanya kubanga, mwanganya mwana malangu na mwenhesa kuhenga hindu samboni biipwaga, ‘Sakaka bandu bunndema nkolongu gongo abii bana malangu na umanyi!’<verse eid="DEU 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />“Nga bandu bunndema wokapi hata gukubi nkolongu namuna boo, goguwe sapanga waki jubii pambipi na wombi, ngati ejubii pambipi na twepani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, etundoba kutujangati. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Wala nga bandu bunndema gongi wokapi hata gukubi nkolongu namuna boo, gogubi ni mihilu na malagalaki gasapi ngati ganga, ganumboliki lisoba la lelenu.<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />“Lakini mwilihangalia ngani koni mmanya ngase mpalika kugajewa majambu gamugabona kwa mihu ginu mwabeti. Kwipitii hata mala jimu mu womi winu kugajewa majambu haga mu mwoju jinu. Mwaasimulia bana binu na akasokoo binu, <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />kwa majambu gilisoba lela lemwajema palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ku kitobi sa Holebu kola, pajambwagila, ‘Waakusanya bandu bala palongi jane, naapwagila malobi gangu ili bilibola kuntende isima Sapanga masoba goti gukutama kwabu na kwaabola bana babu kuhenga hela.’<verse eid="DEU 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />“Ndienu, mwapwagila bana binu hemwahegaliya nukujema pai jikitombi sela sesuse kipindi hesi sabiya kijaka mwotu guwahika kunani nukuyekalelwii ni likongobu lingipi. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga jalongila na mwanganya kuhuma pikilanda ja mwotu hogu, mwajowana malobi gajalongila lakini ngase mwawesa kumbona, mwajowana pee sauti jaki. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Jwombi juntangasia lilaganu laki jundagalakia mulipwata nukujetake mihilu komi jejuje juandiki mu ibau ibeli ya malibu. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Kipindi hesi Bambu Sapanga janagalakia numbola mihilu na malagalaki goti gaguge mpalika kugatimisa mu nndema gonzenda kugukamu gubiya gwinu.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli baalakali kulumbali imong'umong'u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />“Henu nnhangalia mwiijewa kubanga, Bambu Sapanga pajwalongila na mwanganya ku kitombi sa Holebu kola pikilanda ja mwotu ngase mumbwene namuna hejabii. Kwa ndaba heji mwilihangali ngani, <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />Mwiihenga mahakuu sukulilenganake imong'umong'u yeilengana na mwanalomi au mmbomba, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />yeilengana ni kinyama jokapi jojubii kunani au yeilengana ni ijune yeihomba kunani, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />au kulenganesa ni kinyama sekikwaba pai au homba yumu masi. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Mwilihangalia ndaba kipindi pa mwiilingaliya nukulibona lyoba na mwei na ndondu na hindu yoti yukunani kwaka Sapanga, yankoloo kwiilumbali wala kuitumaki, ndaba hindu heyi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jwiibomba kwa ndaba ja bandu bowa bupundema. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Lakini mwanganya ndi mwa bandu bajunkombula kuhuma ku nndema uku Misili kobabi ngati abii mu litanuli lukuhugati yomayoma. Jumpia hoku ili mbia mwa bandu baki ngati embii lelenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />Ndaba jinu Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, janhengila inyela nepani, jalapa kubanga nepani nganiloboki losi luku Yoludani nukujingi mu nnndema wamboni goguwe jumpekee gubiya gwinu. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Nepani ngiti nhwelila mu nndema gongo wala nganiloboki losi, lakini mwanganya mbii pambipi kululoboka nukujenda kugukamu nndema wamboni hogu. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Mwilihangalia ngani mwalijewa lilaganu lelule Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, juhengikiki na mwanganya, mwakilenganake kimong'umong'u sukubasa nu kukilenganesa na sindu sokapi sesuse Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, junkanaki kundenganesa, <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapang winu, ndi mwotu gogutinii, jwombi ndi Sapanga jojubi na wipu.<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />“Emwibiya ntemi mu nndema hogu nu kupata bana na akasokoo na kuba mwa aseja, anamwitumbuliya kujewa nu kuilenganake imong'umong'u yu kubasa nukulenganesa na sindu sokapi nu kuhenga ubaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nukunhenga jubiya ni inyela, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />enuu, lelenu nepani nukukema kunani na pai punndema kulingalia nu kujowane pikilanda jitu ganonge nepani, numpwagi ana mala jimu pe mwiikomika tipitipi mu nndema gomwiijenda kutama kwii ja losi luku Yoludani. Ngamwiitami hoku masoba ginge, ila pe mwikomika tipitipi. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Bambu Sapanga jwampesangana mukatama na bandu bi milema jengi, bandu asokopi pena babihigaliya hoku kokukwe Bambu Sapanga jwaabengila. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Hoku mwaitumakia isapanga yeilenganakiwi kwi mikongu na malibu kwa maboku ga bandu, yeyuye ngaseiwesa kulinga wala kujowana ngaseikula wala kunua. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Ndienu kuhuma mu nndema hogu mwantaputa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nanamu mwampata ngati ana muntapwiti kwa mwoju wii woti na kwa loho joti. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Majambu haga goti pagampata nukupata mang'aliku, mwankelabukia Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu nu kunzetakela. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ndi Sapanga jujubi ni ikia ngajwandeki wala kunkoma, wala kulijewa lilaganu lejahengiki na akahoku binu sakwalapila.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />“Nholaliya majambu ga mwandi, majambu gagapitila kabula ja mwanganya kusaliwa, tumbuka lisoba lela Sapanga pajummbomba mundu pu nndema. Ndalukia kunani kwaka Sapanga nu pu nndema poti, kutumbuli pandu pamu hadi pangi, ngati ana lijambu lukusangasa la namuna ajee lipiti kabee au kujowaneka! <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Boo, nga bandu bokapi kabee baajowini sauti jaka Sapanga jakalongila pikilanda ja mwotu, ngati mwanganya emwajowana, nukuhigali mwa bome? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Boo, jubii lee sapanga jokapi jongi jojulengikiki hata pasokopi kujenda kwaajukuu bandu bu nndema waki kuhuma ku nndema gonge? Lakini Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, sa kwaalenga na kwa nginyuli na kwa ndonduke na kwa ngondu na kwa makili gaki makolongu jwahenga majambu gukutisa, gaguge mwanganya mwagabona kwa mihu ginu ku nndema uku Misili kola. <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Mwanganya mugabweni majambu haga, ili nhwesa kumanya Bambu Sapanga, kanzika jaki ndi Sapanga na wala nga jongi kabete. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Juunhenga mwijijowana sauti jaki kuhuma kunani ili ammbola kunzetake jombi punndema pani, junhenga mugubona mwotu waki nkolongu nu kujowane malobi gaki kuhuma pikilanda ja mwotu hogu. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Ndaba jaapaliki akahoku binu, ndienu junhagwi mwanganya mombii ibeleku yabu, jumpia mweni kuhuma mu nndema uku Misili kwa makili gaki makolongu. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Jwaabenga palongi jinu bandu bi milema mikolongu na bababii na makili kupeta mwanganya, ili jumpekia nndema wabu gubia winu, ngati ekubi mbaka lelenu! <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Ndienu, nkombuka lelenu nukugabeka mumwoju jinu, kubanga Bambu Sapanga ndi Sapanga jukunani na pai pu nnndema, wala ngakuba Sapanga jonge. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Henu mpwata malagalaki ni mihilu jaki jejuje numpekee lelenu ili nneng'aninya, mwanganya pamu ni ibeleku yinu, nu kutama masoba gingi mu nndema gojumpeki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jumpeki gubia winu masoba goti ganga na mwisu.”<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misi jukutili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Ndienu Musa jujihagula misi jitatu upandi wa golipiti lyoba wa losi lwa Yoludani, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />momuje mundu juwesa kutili nukulilamisa, ngati na jukomiki mundu jojuwe nga mbaja waki na ngasanauli. Mundu ngati hoju juwesa kutili kati ja musi gumu nukugalamisa womi waki. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Juguhagula musi uku Beseli gowabi puubamba upulungweza hogu kwa ndaba jilikabila la Lubeni na musi uku Lamoti mu nndema uku Gileadi kwa ndaba jilikabila la Gadi na musi uku Golani mu nndema uku Bashani kwa ndaba ji likabila la Manase.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa jaapwagi kabee Aizilaeli mihilu jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Jenze ndi mihilu jejuje Musa jaapwagila Aizalaeli. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Ganga ndi matemuli na malagalaki ni mihilu jejuje Musa jaapwagila Aizalaeli pabahuma ku nndema uku Misili, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />pababiya kwii ja losi luku Yoludani, mu ligomba lelabi palongi ja musi uku Beti Peoli, mu nndema gowabi uka bambu nkolongu Sihoni jwa Aamoli jojalongusa kuboke ku musi uku Heshiboni, goguwe Musa na Aizalaeli batenda kunhwesa pabahuma ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Bugujukua nndema waki nu nndema uka bambu nkolongu Ogu juku Bashani. Aka bambu akolongu abeli haba ba Aamoli balongusa ku upandi golipiti lyoba ja losi luku Yoludani. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Nndema hogu wajaganiya kuboke ku musi uku Aloeli mu nkenga wa losi luku Alinoni, mbaka kukitombi suku Silioni, sesuse ndi sebikikema Helumoni, <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />pamu ni lieneu loti lu upandi golipiti lyoba ja losi luku Yoludani mbaka ku nhanga uku Alaba kwi kihele sikitombi sa Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s">Mihilu komi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Kuboka 20:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Musa jwaakema pamu Aizilaeli boti, jaapwagila, “Mwaa Aizilaeli, nzowania mihilu na malagalaki gaguge isinongila palongi jinu lelenu. Mulibola haga nu kugahenga sukulilingali. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, jwahenga lilaganu na twepani kukitombi suku Holebu liina lengi Sinai. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Ngasejwahenga lilaganu heli na akahoku bitu pena, ila jwahenga na twepani twaboa twetubi twabomi lelenu. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Bambu Sapanga jalongila na mwanganya ana kwa ana kukitombi pikilanda ja mwotu. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Kipindi hesi nepani najemiki pikilanda jinu mwanganya na Bambu Sapanga, nukuntangasi malobi gajapwaga ndaba mwanganya mwajogupa mwotu gola na ngasemwakwei kukitombi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">“Bambu Sapanga japwaga ana, <verse eid="DEU 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />‘Nepani ndi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku nenugupiiki ku nndema uku Misili, kowabii guntumwa.’<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“Wiikuba ni isapanga yengi ila pe nepani. <verse eid="DEU 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />‘Wiilenganake imong'omong'u yukubasa kwa ndaba ji isapanga, wala kukilenganesa sindu sokapi sekibi kunani, wala sekibii pai pu nndema, wala sekibi mmasi pai ju nndema.’<verse eid="DEU 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />“Waijinamii wala kuilumbali, ndaba nepani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, ndi Sapanga jojubii na wipu. Naalapu bana kwa ndaba ja mahakau gakatati babu, hata kibeleku sa tatu na su nsesi na sa bandu baanzukila. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Lakini naalangi wamboni bandu maelupu baambala nukupwata mihilu jangu.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />“Walilogo bwaka liina langu nepani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, ndaba nepani ndi Bambu Sapanga nganisindwi kundapu jokapi jola jojihenga hela. <verse eid="DEU 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />Mulipwata Lisoba Lukupomulela nukulibeka palongi jangu nepani ngati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, enugulagalakia. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Masoba sita nhenga mahenga nu kuhenga majambu gaku goti, <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />lakini lisoba la saba ndi Lisoba Lukupomulela lelule nilihagwi kwa ndaba jangu. Lisoba heli wehapa wiihenga lihengu jokapi, wala mwana waku, wala kamwali waku wala babuguhenge lihengu akanalomi au akambomba, wala ng'ombi yaku, wala maponda gaku, wala mipugu jaku jokapi, wala nng'eni jojubii nnyumba jaku, na atumwa babuguhenge lihengu mwanalomi au mmbomba awesa kupomulela ngati wehapa. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Wiijewa ngati wehapa wabii guntumwa ku nndema uku Misili, nepani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, nugupia hoku sukutumi makili gangu gingi, ndi ndaba nepani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, nugulagalaki ulikamula Lisoba Lukupomulela.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />“ ‘Waahengila isima atati baku na amabu baku, ngati nepani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku enugulagalakia, guhenga hela ili guwesa kutama masoba gingi nu kuwesa kujetakalewa mu nndema gonugupeke.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“ ‘Wiikoma.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“ ‘Wiitenda ugoni.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“ ‘Wiijiba.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“ ‘Waankopake nnzaku isoli.<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“ ‘Waantokule nhanu uku nnzaku, wala wajitokule nyumba jaki, wala nngonda waki, wala ntumwa waki mwanalomi au mbomba, wala ng'ombi yaki, wala maponda gaki, wala sindu sokapi sejubi nasu nzaku.’<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />“Heji ndi mihilu jejuje Bambu Sapanga ampwagila mwaboti sukujamalia kuhumi ku mwotu ni lihundi likolongu na mulwii tii. Jumpwagila pamwabiya nkemini nsambi kukitombi kola na ngasejajonzuki nhilu gonge. Ndienu jujiandika panani ji ibau ibeli ya malibu najatenda kumbeke.<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lujogopu lwa bandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">Kuboka 20:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />“Kipindi pamwajowana kujamali hoku kuhuma pikilanda ja lwii tii lola, panani jikitombi sesabia kinyaka mwotu sela, akikilongosi boti bama kabila ginu na aka aseja banhikila, <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />nukupwaga, ‘Jowana! Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, jutuyekuli kutulangi ukolongu waki, tujowini sauti jaki kuhuma pikilanda ja mwotu pala. Lelenu ndi tutumbuli kujoana sauti jaka Bambu Sapanga jaka longila na mundu, najombi ngasejawii jaendalia kutama! <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Lakini ndaba jaki tulikoma mu mwotu nkolongu gola? Anatujijowini kabee sauti jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, twiitenda kuwa! <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Boo, jubii mundu boo jojijijowini sauti jaka Sapanga kuhuma pikilanda ja mwotu nu kuendele kuba mwome? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Nambanga wa Musa gujenda pambipi na jombi ukajowania goti gajukapwaga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, ndienu wihika kutupwagi majambu goti gajagupwagila, twepani twagajowania nukugahenga’.<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />“Bambu Sapanga jugajowini malobi gi haga, jambwagila, ‘Nyowini malobi gabugupwagi bandu haba, goti gaapwagiki gaamboni. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Ana masoba goa bakabiya na mawasu ngati ganga, nukuhenge isima nepani nukupwata mihilu jangu! Majambu gabu goti gakaajendila sapi, bombi beni ni ibeleku yabu masoba goti ganga na mwisu. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Henu gujenda wakaapwagila akelubuka mu mahema gabu. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Lakini wa Musa guhigaliya pamba pamu na nepani, nepani ngiti nugupwagila mihilu joti na malagalaki gaguge wiitenda kwaabola, ili nndema gonaapekia gubia mali gabu.’<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />“Mwanganya mlilingaliya, nhenga ngati Bambu Sapanga ejunndagalakia, nhenga kila sindu ngati ejunndagalaki. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Mwajipwata malagalaki goti Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, gajunndagalakia ili majambu gino gawesa kuba sapi na nhwesa kutama masoba gingi mu nndema gomwagujukua gubiya gwinu.<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Nhilu nkolongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />“Jenze ndi mihilu na malagalaki gaguge Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jwanagalakia numbola, ili mugatimisa mu nndema gumwiijenda kutama. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Kipindi soti pamwibia mwabomi kwiipalika kunndumbali Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nukutimisa malagalaki goti ni mihilu jenumpeke mwanganya ni ibeleku inu ili nhwesa kutama masoba gingi. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Nzowania mwabandu buku Izalaeli, nhangalia kujitimisa ili nhwesa kutama kwamboni nukujonzukeka ngani mu nndema gojunndagila hogu gogulengane kulema nu kupugi mipugu jingi.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />“Enu nzowania mwa Izilalaeli! Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, ndi Bambu Sapanga jumu, <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Mumpala Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, kwa mwoju wii woti, na kwa loho jinu joti na kwa makili ginu goti. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Mugabeka mu mioju jinu mihilu jenze jenunndagalaki lelenu, <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />nakwaabola sapi bana binu. Mwaalandila emwiibiya ntama munyumba au mbii nsapwali au panzenda kugone au panzumuka. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Mwagakonga mumaboku ginu nukugawata mu ibongi hii yapamihu gabiya ngati sindu sukunkombuke. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Mugaandika panani ja felemu ji milyangu jinu na mu matanga ga misi jinu.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulakali kwa bandu babiisindwa kujetaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />“Ngati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ejaalapila akahoku binu, Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobu, kubanga jombi jwaampekia nndema gogubii na misi mikolongu na jamboni jejineng'ane jejuje mwanganya ngasemujinsengike. <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />Nyumba jibiya jitweli hindu yamboni yeyuye mwanganya ngase mwiibekike, kwiibiya ni iliba yeyuye mwanganya ngase mwiihembike ni migonda jimizabibu ni mizeituni jejuje mwanganya ngase mwijipandike. Bambu Sapanga ejampeleka mu nndema hogu kokukwe mwiibiya na posu jokapi jemwajipala, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />Nhangalia mwaandeka Bambu Sapanga jojunmpiiki ku nndema uku Misili komwabii mwaatumwa. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Mwaanhengila isima Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, mwaantumakia jombi kajika jaki nukulapa ku lihina laki. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Mwailumbali isapanga yengi, isapanga ya bandu babii pambipi na mwanganya, <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />inyela jaka Bambu Sapanga janhiki mwanganya, na jombi jwankoma mwanganya mwiikuba punndema, ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jubii pikilanda jinu, ndi Sapanga jojubii na wipu.<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />“Mwandenga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ngati emundenga ku Masa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Nkamula sapi mihilu jaki, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, matemuli na malagalaki gaki gaguge jutei kundagalakia. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Nhenga gagapalika kwaka Bambu Sapanga, ili juwesa kuhenga mpata kila sindu. Mwiiwesa kugukamu nndema gola wamboni goguwe Bambu Sapanga jalapiki kubanga jaapekia akahoku binu, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />nu kubanga Bambu Sapanga jaabenga abaja binu ngati ejalagila.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />“Masoba gagihika, bana binu ebilalukia, ‘Boo malagalaki haga gaguge Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, jutulagalaki gabii na maana bole?’ <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Mwanganya mwajibua ana, ‘Twepani twabii twaatumwa kwaka bambu nkolongu Falau juku Misili, na Bambu Sapanga jutuokua sukutumi makili gaki makolongu. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Twalinga kwa mihu gitu twabete jaka henga nginyuli ikolongu na ndonduke na majambu gukujogoa kwa bandu buku Misili, bambu nkolongu na bandu baki boti. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Jutupia ku nndema uku Misili, nukutuleta pamba nu kutupekee nndema gongo, ngati ejalapa kubanga jaapekia akahoku bitu. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Henu, Bambu Sapanga jutulagalakia kujipwata mihilu heji joti nu kuntende isima kwa ndaba jukuneng'ane twabete, ili jutulenda masoba goti ngati hejuhenga lelenu. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Kabee twiiwesa kujetakalewa Sapanga ngati ana tutimisi sukuhangali mihilu heji joti palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, ngati ejutulagalakia.’<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">Bandu bahaguliwi na Bambu Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Kuboka 34:11-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />“Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jwanhikisa ku nndema goguwe mwiijenda kugujukuu gubiya gwinu na jaabenga bandu bi milema jingi kuhuma mu nndema hogu. Pamwiijingala mu nndeme gomugujende kugujukua jaabenga bandu ba makabila gangi saba makolongu na gagabi namakili kupeta mwanganya palongi jinu makabila ge ndi, Ahiti na Agiligashi na Aamoli na Akanani na Apelizi na Ahivi na Ayebusi. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Kabee, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, kwaalapu na kwaawesa bandu haba mpalika kwaakoma tipitipi, mwiihenga lilaganu lokapi na bombi wala mwaabone ikia. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Mwiitoguleka nabu, wala mwaapia akakamwali binu au akakombu binu kutoguleka nabu. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Ananhengiki hela bombi baahenga bana binu asindwa kumpwata Bambu Sapanga, nukwaahenga bi ilumbaliya isapanga yengi, ni inyela yaka Bambu Sapanga jibia kwinu mwanganya, na jaankoma mala jimu. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Lakini mwaatendila ana, mwaibombulana pandu pabu paasengiki kwa malibu pukupiki matambiku nu kusekulana mapanda ga Ashela nukujosa kwa mwotu imong'umong'u yabu yu kubasa. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Nhenga hela ndaba mwanganya mwabandu baka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. Kati ja bandu boti bu punndema junhagwi mwanganya ili mbia mwabandu baki mweni.”<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />“Bambu Sapanga ngase jumpai mwanganya nu kunhagu kwa ndaba mwanganya mwabii mwabingi ngani kupeta bandu bangi, mwanganya mwabii mwa asoku kupeta bandu bi milema jengi. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Lakini kwa ndaba jaka Bambu Sapanga jutenda kumpala nukupwata kuliga kwaki kujaaligi akahoku binu, ndi ndaba junhokwi kwa sukutumi makili gaki gingi nukumpia kuhuma kukuhenga mahengu gu utumwa, toka pai juulongosi uka bambu nkolongu Falau juku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Henu, mmanya kubanga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ndi Sapanga na ndi Sapanga jojuhobaleka, jojulipwata lilaganu laki na kwaahenge gaamboni ibeleku hingi yeipwata mihilu jaki. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Lakini jwaalepa sekipalika kwa babunsuki bala, wala ngajikotoki kwaalapu babunsukila. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Henu nhangalia kupwata mihilu, na malagalaki ganundangalaki lelenu.”<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu baajetake mihilu bitenda kupengewa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Kukomboka 28:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />“Ana mugajowani malagalaki aga nukugapwata nukugahenga, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ngajalijewi lilaganu laki na mwanganya janndangia wamboni waki ngati ejaalagila akahoku binu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Jwampala nukumpenge, nanamu mwiijonzukika na kuba na bana bingi, jajipengila migonda jinu ili mpata ilebi na divai na mahuta gi mizeituni, jampengila sukumpeke ng'ombi na makondoo gingi mu nndema gojaalagila akahoku binu kubanga jampekia mwanganya. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Mwiipengaliwa kupeta bandu bangi boti bu pundema. Pikilanda jinu ngakwiikubi na mwanalomi au mmbomba jwanga kuwesa kuba na bana. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Bambu Sapanga jamboakia magonzu goti na ngagampati magonzu gokapi gukujogopesa ngati gagumpata ku Misili, lakini magonzu haga isijaapekia abaja binu. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Mwaakoma bandu bundema wokapi goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, janhenga mwaawesa, wala mwaabone ikia. Mwilumbali isapanga yabu, ndaba lihengu heli libia ntegu kwinu”.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />“Mwalipwagi mu mioju jinu, ‘Bandu haba abi bingi kupeta twepani, twiiwesa boo kwaabenga mu nndema mone?’ <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Mwaajogopa, nkombuka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, eanhengila Falau nu nndema woti uku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Nkombuka malapuli makolongu gamugabona kwa mihu ginu, nginyuli na majambu gukujogoa na makili makolongu nu uwesu nkolongu, goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jatumia ili kunkombola, hela ndi ejaahenga bandu bamwaajogopa. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Kupeta haga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jagatuma manyigu pikilanda jabu nakwaakoma babitila nu kujoba. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Ndienu, mwajogopa, kwa ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jubii pikilanda jinu. Jombi ndi Sapanga nkolongu jukujogopesa. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jaambenga bandu bi milema hei kadili mwanganya emwiihegalia kulongo mbolimboli. Ngamwiiwesi kwaakoma goti kwa mala jimu, ndaba ananhengiki hela inyama yumukinyoi yiitenda kujonzukeka nu kunzogupesa mwanganya. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jaabeka abaja binu janzangatiya kwaawesa na jaahenga ahangajika mpaka mwaakoma tipitipi. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Jaanhenga mwaakamula aka bambu akolongu babu. Mwaakoma na mwiitenda kwaajewa. Nga mundu jokapi jojiwesa kumpengale, mbaka pamwiibiya mwaakomiki. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Mwaitinia pa mwotu imong'umong'u yabu yoti yukubasa. Mwaitokule madini ga feza gabu wala zahabu yabu, wala mwaitola kuba mali ginu. Kuhenga hela ndi kwiibiya ntegu kwinu na sibiya sindu sukusukisa kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Mwiipeleka kunyumba jinu sindu sokapi sukusukisa, ana nhengiki hela mwiipata yambamba ngati sindu hesi. Ndi lasima kukisuki nu kukipolesa lihamu ngani ndaba ndi sindu hesi Sapanga jikiligi mbamba.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">Nndema wamboni go tujenda kugujuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />“Mihilu joti jenumpeke lelenu, kupalika mwijipwata sukulingali ngamaa ili nhwesa kutama nukujonzukeka, ili nhwesa kujingi nukujikamu nndema gola goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, junndapila kubanga jwaapekia akahoku binu. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Nkombuka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ejundongua mu indela joti kupete kulukoba kwa yaka alubaini, ili junhenga mbia na makili sukundenga ili juwesa kumanya nhwasali kii mu mioju jii na ngati mwijipwata mihilu jaki au ngamwajipwate. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Junhenga mmbia na makili sukunndeka mmbona inzala na mwenikatai jumpekia posu jebijikema mana nkula, posu jeheji ngasemwijimanyike wala akahoku binu ngasebikimanyike. Jahenga hela ili jumbola kubanga mundu ngasejuwesa kutama kwa ndaba ji libumunda pena, ila pe kwa kila lilobi lejulonge Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Kwa yaka alubaini ingobu yii ngaseyalaile, wala magolu ginu ngasegahimbike. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Nkombuka kubanga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, junhenga mbiya ni isima sukundapu ngati atati eanhenga mwanamundu. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Ndienu, mwiipwata mihilu jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ili nhwesa kujenda mwiindela jaki nu kuntende isima jombi. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu janzingia mu nndema wamboni, nndema gogubi ni iliba na chemichemi, na masi gaganyika kuhuma mu magomba na mwiitombi, <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />nndema gukulema inganu na shayili na mizabibu ni mikongu ji mitini ni mikomamanga ni mizeituni na gogubii na busi. <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />Hoku mwiipata posu jingipi wala nga mwiipungukiwi na sindo. Malibu gaki makolongu gabii gikisomasoma, na muitombi yaki nhwesa kuhemba madini ga shaba. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Mwiikula nukutupi, mwansengula Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ku nndema wa sapi gojumpeki.”<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwannzewa Bambu Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />“Nndingalia nga mwaanzewi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, sukusindwa kupwata mihilu jaki, malagalaki gaki, gajunndagalaki lelenu. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Emwikula nukutupi, nu kusenga nyumba ja mboni nu kutama homu, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />ni kipindi makundi gi ng'ombi ni imbui na makondoo ginu pagibia gajonzukiki na madini ga zahabu na madini ga feza yinu paibia ijonzukiki na kila sindu sembii nasu pakiibiya kijonzukiki, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />mwiikuba ni ing'omu nukunzewa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jojumpia mu nndema uku Misili, komwabii mwaatumwa. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Ndi jojundongusa mu lukoba lukolongu na lolujogopesa, lolubi na majoka gagabi na sumu ni ipelee ikolongu mu nndema nzomu gola gowabi nga na masi, jumpikia masi kuhuma mu lilibu likolongu lelabi nganganganga. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Kabee ndi jojundea posu jebijikema mana kulukoba, posu jeheji akahoku binu ngasebawesiki kujimanya. Jwahenga haga goti ili junhenga mbia na makili nu kundenga, ili kumpema na juwesa kunhenge majambu gaamboni. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Ndienu mwilihangalia mwalipwagi mu mioju jinu, ‘Tubii na mali gingi kuuwesu na makili gitu twabeti.’ <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Nkombuka kubanga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, ndi jojumpeke uwesu wa kuba na mali gingi. Juhenga hela ndaba jukutimisa lilaganu lejahenga na akahoku binu mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Lakini anamunzewiki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, nu kuipwata isapanga yengi ili kuitumaki nu kuigungamalii, nundakali su ukali lelenu kyekye mwiitenda kuwa. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Ana ngamwanzowane Bambu Sapanga, mwiikuwa ngati bandu banga Aizalaeli ebaakoma palongi jinu.”<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s">Bandu akana kunzetake Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 32:1-35">Kuboka 32:1-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />“Nzowania mwaka Aizilaeli! Lisoba la lelenu nhegali pambipi kuloboka losi luku Yoludani, kujenda kugujuku nndema nkolongu wa bandu banga Ayaudi na baabi na makili kuliku mwanganya. Misi jabu ndi mikolongu na jejibii nu mimatu jejihika mbaka kunani ngani. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Bandu be ndi alasu na babi na makili, ndi baakema Aanaki babube mmanyiki majambu gabu na nzowini bandu heapwaga, ‘Nya jojuwesa kukomana na Aanake?’ <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Mmanya lelenu kubanga jojundongule kulongi ngati mwotu gogutinii ndi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. Jombi jaakoma haba nakwaawesa palongi jinu, ndienu mwaabenga nakwaakoma mala jimu, ngati Bambu Sapanga ejundagila.”<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />“Baada jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, kwaabenga bandu habu palongi jinu, mwakipuna mu mioji jinu kubanga, ‘Ndaba ja waamboni witu ndi Bambu Sapanga jutuletiki tutama mu nndema gongo,’ na kumbi Bambu Sapanga jwaabengiki bandu haba palongi jinu kwa ndaba ju ubaja wabu. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Nhwesa kutama mu nndema wabu si ndaba mwanganya mbii mwamboni au mwe mbii na mioju ja sapi, ila pe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jwaabenga bandu haba polongi jinu kwa ndaba juubaja wabu na ili kutimisa lilobi lejaalapila akahoku binu Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobu. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Ndienu, mmanya kubanga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jumpekee nndema gongo gubiya winu nga kwa waamboni winu ndi mpalika kugutama nndema, ila ndaba mwanganya ndi mwa bandu mwembii ni ing'omu.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />“Nkombuka wala mwiijewa emunhenga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jubia niinyela, kulukoba kola. Kutumbuli lisoba lela lemwaboka ku nndema uku Misili mbaka lisoba lemwahika pamba, mwanganya nkuba mung'anambuka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Hata ku kitombi sa Holebu kola munhenga jubia ni inyela Bambu Sapanga, najombi jwabia ni inyela ngani, mbaka japala kunkoma. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Enakwela kukitombi kujopa ibau ya malibu yeyuye yaandikwi lilaganu lelule Bambu Sapanga jahenga na mwanganya, natemi hoku masoba alubaini, ikilu na muhi, ngasenakuliki wala kunywa sindu sokapi. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jambekia ibau ibeli ya malibu yeyaandikwi kulukonzi lwaki, yabiya iandikwi malobi goti gaguge Bambu Sapanga jumpwagila kukitombi kuhuma mu mwotu lisoba le twaketangana pamu. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Enaa, baada ja masoba alubaini ikilu na muhi, Bambu Sapanga jambekia ibau ibeli ya malibu yeyuye yaandikwi lilaganu.<verse eid="DEU 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />“Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jambwagila, ‘Guboka, guhuluka pai jikitombi kanyata, ndaba bandu baku bawaaboiki ku nndema uku Misili atei kulihalabana. Bijilei kanyata indela jela jenaalagalakia bijipwata na bililenganaki kimong'umong'u.’<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />“Kabee Bambu Sapanga jambwagila, ‘Naabweni bandu aba ndi babi ni ing'omu ngamaa, <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />gunekaje naakoma nukuliputi kutali lihina labu puundema, na nepani naguhenga wehapa kuba atati bu nndema nkolongu na gogubii na makili makolongu kupeta bombi.’<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />“Ndienu, nang'anambuka nu kuhuluka kuhuma kukitombi, koni ndotwi ibau ibeli ya malibu, na mwotu wabiya gutenda kunyaka kukitombi. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Enalinga, nabona munhengi mahakau Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, mwililenganaki kimong'umong'u, sanga kuselewa mwabia mujilei indela jaka Bambu Sapanga jejundangalakia. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Ndipala, natondubia ibau ibeli yela nukuileke pai, niikajulana palongi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Ndienu, nagonila pai nulutumbu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, ngati enahenga pa kwatumbulia, kwa masoba alubaini ikilu na muhi, ngase nakuliki posu wala kunywa masi, kwa ndaba jamahakau gagabia mugahengiki mwanganya, suku henga ubaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga sukunhenga jubia ni inyela. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Najogupa inyela na azabu jaka Bambu Sapanga kwa ndaba jinu mwanganya, ndaba jukunkoma mwanganya, lakini Bambu Sapanga jatenda kunyowane kipindi sela. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Kabee Bambu Sapanga jabia ahengi ngani inyela Aloni kulagi junkomi, ndipala, nundobila Aloni kipindi sese. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Sindu kibaja sela, sesuse ndi litoli la ng'ombi semwabia mulilenganakili, nikijukua nukukijosa pa mwotu, nikitipatipa nuku kiyagayaga, na kuba ngati luhombi lolulembuliki ndi nulujitala luhombi holu mu kalosi kakanyika pai gikitombi hesi.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />“Kabee muhenga jubia ni inyela Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, pamwabia ku Tabela na Masa na ku Kibuloti hataava. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Na Bambu Sapanga pajuntuma kuhuma ku Kadeshi balinea japwaga, ‘Nzendania mukugujukua nndema gonumpeki.’ Mwanganya mwatenda kukana ngasemunhobali wala kugapwata gajumpwagila gala. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Mwanganya mu munntendi ing'omu Bambu Sapanga tumbuka lisoba lenumanya.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />“Ndienu, nagonila lutumbu pai palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga masoba alubaini ikilu na muhi kwa ndaba Bambu Sapanga japwaga jutenda kunkoma. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Nundoba Bambu Sapanga koni nakapwaga, ‘Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, waakoma bandu baku, bandu baku wamwete, bandu bawaakombula nakwapia mu nndema uku Misili kuuwesu na makili gaku makolongu. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Waakombuka atumisi baku Abulahamu ni Isaka na Yakobu, wala wilingali kugukana kwabu, ubaja na mahakau ga bandu ababa. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Bandu kohutupiiki kola biipwaga, wa Bambu Sapanga utupiiki ili kutukoma kulukoba kwa ndaba ngasejawesiki kwaajingisa mu nndema gojaalagilaje ndaba jaatei kwa suki. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Ndaba bamba ndi bandu baku wamweti, bandu bawaapiiki ku nndema uku Misili kwa makili nu uwesu waku nkolongu.’<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Musa jujopa kabe mihilu komi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Kuboka 34:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />“Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga jambwagila, ‘Hongula ibau ibeli ya malibu ngati yu kutumbuli yela ni lisanduku li imbau, ndi guhika kwangu nepani kunani kukitombi kongo, <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />nanepani niiandika malobi goti ganabiya nagaandiki muibau yewitunula, na kabee wiibeka ibau heyi mu lisanduku.’<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />“Ndipala, nalenganakia lisanduku sukutumi imbau yu nkongu gobugukema mshita ni ibau ibeli ya malibu ngati yukutumbuli yela, nakwela nayu kukitombi. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Bambu Sapanga jaandika mu ibau mola malobi galaga ngati ga mwandi gala. Mihilu komi jeampekia mwanganya pajalongila kuhuma pikilanda ja mwotu lisoba letwaketangana pamu. Ndi Bambu Sapanga jambekia ibau ibeli heyi. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Nang'anambuka, nukuhuluka kuhuma kukitombi, ngati Bambu Sapanga ejanagalakia, niibeka ibau yela mu lisanduku lenabia nililenganakii, ni ibii nkati ji lisanduku heli, ngati Bambu Sapanga ejanagalakia.”<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />Aizalaeli babia mu sapwali kuhuma mu iliba ya bandu buku Yaakani mbaka ku Mosela. Hapu ndi Aloni jatenda kuwa, na batenda kuntaga. Eleazali mwanamundu, jajukua napwasi jaki ngati nngolu. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Kuboke hapu babia nsapwali mbaka ku Gudigoda, nu kuboke ku Gudigoda mbaka ku Yotibata, pandu papabi nu tulosi twingi twa masi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Kipindi hesi Bambu Sapanga jaahagula bandu bi likabila la Lawi abia baatoto lisanduku lililaganu laka Bambu Sapanga, antumakia ngati agolu nu kwaapenge bandu kwi liina laki mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Ndaba bandu bi likabila la Alawi ngasebabii na pandu pabaapekia pabia pabu pamu na kaalongumundu, sebajopa ndi isima pena ya kuba akagolu baka Bambu Sapanga, ngati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, ejalagila.<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />“Natama kukitombi kwa masoba alubaini, ikilu na muhi ngati pamwandi. Bambu Sapanga janyowania kabee mala jengi na jajetakia kubanga ngajunkomi mwanganya. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Ndienu jambwagila, ‘Guboka guendalia na sapwali jaku jukwaalongosa bandu ili awesa kujingi nu kujijuku gubia gwabu nndema gonaalapila akahoku binu kubanga niitenda kumpeke.’<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sejupala Bambu Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />“Henu, Aizalaeli Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jupala kike kwinu mwanganya, ila pe kundumbali Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu nukujipwata indela jaki nu kumpala nu kutumakila Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, kwa mioju jinu joti na kwa loho yinu yoti, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />nu kujikamu mihilu na malagalaki gaka Bambu Sapanga ganumbeke lelenu, ili majambu gii gunnzendila sapi? <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Linga kunani hata kunani ju kunani ngani ndi mali gaki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nndema na hindu yoti yeibii homu ndi mali gaki. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Kabee Bambu Sapanga jwaapala akahoku binu ngani, junhagula mwanganya mo mmbii ibeleku yabu ili nkuba mwabandu baki badala ja bandu bangi boti, ngati ekubi lelenu. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Henu, kutumbuli lelenu munzowania Bambu Sapanga, wala mwiikuba ni ing'omu kabee. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ndi Sapanga jwi isapanga na Bambu wa aka bambu jwombi ndi Sapanga nkolongu, na jojujogopeka, ngasejupendale wala ngasejujopa lushwa. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Jwaakengale bandu banga na atati wala amabu na akambomba baawii akaalomi babu, na kwaapeke posu ni ingobu. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Mwaapala ageni ndaba mwanganya nanamu mwabii mwa ageni ku nndema uku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Mundumbalia Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, muntumakia kajika jaki nukujongana naku nu nndapa kwi lihina laki. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Jombi ndi jompalika kunndumbali, ndi Sapanga winu jojunhengi majambu makolongu haga na gukutisa gamugabona kwa mihu ginu mwabete. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Akahoku binu pabajenda ku nndema uku Misili, babia bandu sabini pena, lakini sajenu Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, junhengiki kuba mwa bingi ngati ndondu yukunani.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">Ukolongu uka Bambu Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />“Kwa ndaba heji mumpala Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nukupwata masoba goti indela jaki na malagalaki gaki ni mihilu jaki. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Nholalia sukuhangali, ndaba bana binu ngasebamanyiki wala kulapuliwa na Bambu Sapanga wala uwesu waki wala makili gaki, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />na nginyuli yaki na ndonduke yejwiihenga kunndema uku Misili kuka bambu nkolongu Falau juku Misili nu nndema waki woti, <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />bana bii ngasebagabweni gajaahengila akomana ngondu buku Misili, inyama yabu yebiikema falasi na magali gabu ga ngondu, namuna ejaalekala akomana ngondu habu mu nhanga nkolongu uku Shamu, na namuna Bambu Sapanga ejwilikoma mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Kabee nkombuka nga bana binu babagabona gajunhengila Bambu Sapanga pamwabi kulukoba kabula jukuhika pamba, <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />wala majambu gajwaahenga aka Dasani na Abilamu, bana baka Eliabu jabiya ju likabila la Lubeni namuna nnndema ewahoguka nukwaamila boti pamu nakaalongu babu, mahema gabu, inyama na akatumisi babu boti palongi ja bandu boti Aizalaeli. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Lakini kwa ndaba mwanganya mwagabweni majambu makolongu haga gaguge Bambu Sapanga jatei kugahenga.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majambu gaamboni guku nndema go butulagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />“Mwijipwata mihilu joti jenundagalaki lisoba lende, ili nhwesa kujingi nukugujuku nndema gomugujendela ili gubiya winu, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />ili nhwesa kutama masoma gingi mu nndema hogu gogubi nu luombi lwa sapi kukulema nu kupugii mipugu, nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga jalagila kwaapeke akahoku binu ni ibeleku yabu. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Kwa ndaba nndema gonzenda kugujuku gubiya winu nga ngati nndema uku Misili komwahumaji, komwapanda ilebi, nukujitalia masi kwa magolu ngati migonda ja makolu. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Lakini nndema gonzenda kutama ndi nndema wiitombi na magomba, nndema goguwe gokunii iyula kuhuma kunani, <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jutenda kugutunza, Bambu Sapanga juguhangali kambelikambeli tumbuka kutumbuli kwa saka mbaka mwisu wa saka.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />“Ndienu, ngati ana mpwatiki mihilu jangu jenunpeke lelenu, mumpala Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nukuntumakia kwa mwoju wii woti na kwa loho ji joti, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />jombi jwagukunila iyula nndema winu kwi kipindi saki, iyula jikihuku ni iyula nzokunzoku, nanamu mwiihusa ilebi yinu na divai jinu na mahuta ginu. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Jwiimelisa manyai mu migonda kwa ndaba ja ng'ombi yinu, nanamu mwiikula nukutupi. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Mwilihangalia, bankolo nukung'anambuka kuitumaki isapanga yengi nu kuilumbali, <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />ana nhengiki hela Bambu Sapanga jiitenda kunyome mwanganya, nu kujihenga iyula jiikuna nu nndema kukotoka kumelesa ilebi yaki, nanamu mwiikuwa nyatanyata mu nndema wamboni goguwe Bambu Sapanga jutei kumpekee.<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />“Mugabeka malobi gangu haga mu mioju jinu na mu loho jinu. Mugakonga mumaboku ginu nukugawata mwiibongi yinu ili gabia ngati nginyuli yukunkombuke. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Mwaabola banabinu malaobi haga nu kugalongale pantama mu nyumba yinu, panzenda na panzenda kugone na panzumuka. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Muiandika mu felemu ja nyumba yinu, na mu matanga ginu, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />ili mwanganya na bana binu nhwesa kutama masoba gingi mu nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jwalapa kwaapekee akahoku binu. Mwiitama masoba goti ngati kunani ku maundi hekuendale kuba kunani junndema.<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />“Anamwilihangali nu kupwata mihilu joti jenumpeki, kumpala Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, kujipwata indela jaki joti nu kujongana najombi, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jwaabenga bandu boti palongi jinu, nanamu mwiitama mu nndema gowabi mali ga bandu baabi bingi na babi na makili gingi kupeta mwanganya. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Kila pandu payikanyata yaji ya magolu ginu piibiya pinu, nndema winu wiibiya tumbuka kulungwenza upandi ukusini, mbaka ku itombi ya Lebanoni upandi uku kasikazini, nukuhuma ku losi luku Efulati gowabii upandi golipiti lyoba, mbaka kunhanga nkolongu uku Meditelanea gogubii upandi golijingi lyoba. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Nga mundu jokapi jojwiiwesa kumpenga. Pokapi pamwiijenda mu nndema hogu, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jaahenga bandu bunzogupa, ngati ejundagila.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />“Ndingalia, lelenu numbekii palongi jinu kupengalewa na kupata yambamba, <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Mwiipata mbenge, ngati anampwatiki mihilu jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jenundagalaki lelenu, <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />na mwiipata yambamba ngati ana ngasempwatiki mihilu jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nu kujileka indela jenundagalakia, nukuilumbali isapanga yengi yeyuye ngasenhwahiki kuimanya. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Bambu Sapanga pajwanhikisa kunndema gonzenda kugujukuu gubia winu, mwiilandila mbenge kuhuma kukitombi sa Gelizimu, na yambamba kuhuma kukitombi sa Ebali. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Ngati he mmanya Itombi heyi ibii kwiii ja losi luku Yoludani, upandi golijingi lyoba wi indela jejijenda kolijingi lyoba, mu nndema ja bandu Akanani baatama kuligomba ja losi luku Yoludani pambipi na musi uku Giligali. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Kwipalika kuloboka losi luku Yoludani nu kujingi kukamu nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jitenda kumpeke. Emwagujukua na kuba winu nukutama homu, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />Mpalika kukamu mihilu joti na malagalaki ganumpekee lelenu.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Pandu pakajika pukulumbali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />“Jenze ndi mihilu na malagalaki gaguge mwagahenga mu nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa akahoku binu, jumpeki gubia winu masoba goti gukutama kwinu mu nndema hogu. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Nhalabana ngani pandu poti paalumbali bandu isapanga yabu kwiitombi ilasu, mututombi na pai ji mikongu mikolongu jejibi na manyai mabei. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Ntunula tipitipi mesa yabu yukupiiki matambiku nu kubombulane ako mipendi jambu. Ntinia kwa mwotu imong'umong'u yabu ya Ashela nu kuisekulana imong'umong'u yabu yukubasa nu kuliputa liina labu pandu pabu.<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />“Wala mwandumbali Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ngati bombi healumbali. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Ila pe mwiijenda kulumbali papupe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, pajapahagula mu makabila gi goti, ili kulibeka liina laki na pandu pukutama, hoku ndi komwiijenda. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Hoku ndi mwiipelaka matambiku ginu gukutinia na matambiku ginu na zaka yinu yemwimbikia, matambiku ginu gukulagi, na matambiku gukupia sukupala ni ibeleku yukutumbuli ya ng'ombi na makondoo ginu. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Hoku mwiikula palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, na mwiitogulia mwanganya pamu na bandu bu nnyumba jinu kwa ndaba jukupata majambu gaamboni kojumpengila Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />“Mwiihenga ngati etuhenga sajenu, kila mundu ngati ejupala kuhenga mweni, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />ndaba mwakona ngasenzingi mu nndema gojumpeke, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, komwiitama kulukwali. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Lakini pa mwiilobuka losi luku Yoludani nu kutama mu nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jampekia kuba gwiinu, na pajaanhenga mpomulia sulukwali na bansumbu abaja binu babunyongulata. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Ndienu, pandu pala Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, pajwapahagula ili lihina laki litama, hapu ndi pamwiipelika kila sindu senundagalaki matambiku ginu gukutinia na matambiku ginu, zaka yinu na matambiku ginu gukulagi kumpiiki Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Hoku mwitogulia palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, mwanganya pamu na banabinu akanalomi na akambomba, na bandu bilikabila la Lawi baatama mu misi jinu, ndaba bombi ngaseabii na pandu pabu pbeni pa baapeki kuba pabu. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Mwililingalia mwiipiya matambiku ginu gukutinia pandu pokapi pamupabona, <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />ila pe pandu pajapahagwi Bambu Sapanga mu likabila limu kati jinu. Hapu ndi pamwiipiya matambiku ginu gukutinii, na ndi pamwanhengila majambu goti gajundagalakia.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />“Lakini nhwesa kusinza na kula inyama hii pokapi pamwiitama. Nhwesa kula inyama ingi kulengana na Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jejumpeki, kulengana na ejanhwesisa Bambu Sapanga. Bandu boti babi sapi au apija awesa kula inyama heji, ngati enkula inyama ja holoku au inyama ja mbabala. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Lakini mwiikula mwai wi inyama heyi, mugujitala mwai hogu puluhombi ngati masi. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Mwiikula hindu aye pamwiitama. Zaka yiilebi yinu, wala ya divai yinu, wala ya mahuta ginu, wala yiibeleku yukutumbuli ya ng'ombi au makondoo ginu, wala matambiku ga nazili au matambiku ginu gukupia sukupala wala matambiku gangi. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Mwiikula hindu heyi palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. Mwiikula mwanganya pamu na bana binu akanalomi na akambomba, atumisi binu akanalomi na akambomba, na bandu bi likabila la Lawi baatama mu misi jinu. Mpalika kutogule palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu kwa kula sindu semwiibeka mumaboku jii. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Kabee mpalika mwaajewa bandu bi likabila la Lawi masoba goti gamwiitama pu nndema jinu.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />“Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, pajwagujonzukia nndema winu, ngati ejalagila nanamu mwiipwaga, ‘Tupala kula inyama,’ kwa ndaba mpala kula inyama, nhwesa kula inyama kiasi sokapi sempala. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Ndienu, pandu pajihagula Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jwalibeka lihina laki, ndi pala nhwesa kusinza ng'ombi au likondoo lokapi lelule Bambu Sapanga jutei kumpeke, ngati enundagalakia na nhwesa kula kiasi sokapi si inyama heji, ngati anambii mu misi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Mwiikula inyama heji ngati enkula ja holoku au jikinyama sa mbabala. Mundu jokapi juwesa kula, jwaasapi au mpija. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Ila pe nndingalia mwiikula mwai, ndaba mwai ndi womi, ndienu mwiikula womi pamu ni inyama. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Mwiikula mwai hogu ila pe mugujitala pai ngati masi. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Mwiikula mwai, mwanganya ni ibeleku ili majambu gii giijenda sapi, ndaba mwiibiya nhenga gamboni palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Hindu ye biibiki kwa ndaba jaka Sapanaga yemwiipiya pamu na matambiku ginu ga nazili, mwaijukua nukuipeleka pandu pajwapahagula Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Pala, mwiipiya matambiku gukutinii inyama na mwai, pandu paasengiki pukupiiki matambiku paka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, mwai wikinyama hesi mwiimisi panani ja pandu pukupiiki matambiku pala, ila pe nhwesa kula inyama jaki. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Mpalika kukamu malobi haga ganundagalaki ili majambu gi gunzendila sapi mwanganya ni ibeleku yinu yoti, kwa ndaba mwiibiya nhenga gamboni na gagajetakewa palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulakali kuigungamali imong'omong'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />“Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, pajajomula kwaakome kutali bandu bi milema jejabii palongi jinu, milema jenzenda kujibenga nukujipia ili ntama mwanganya mu nndema wabu, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />ndingalia mwalijingisa mu ntaba sakwapwata bandu haba baada jakakoma palongi jinu. Mwiihangajika kuimanya isapanga yabu koni mpwaga, ‘Bandu bi milema aje biilumbalia bole isapanga yabo? Ili na twepani tuilumbalia helahela.’ <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Mwandumbali hela Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ndaba kila sindu sukusukisa sesuse Bambu Sapanga ngasejwikipala, bombi biihengi isapanga yabu, hata baajosiki pa mwotu bana babu akanalomi na akambomba, ili kuipiiki litambiku isapanga yabu.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />“Mpalika kuhenga kila sindu senundagalaki, mwiijonzuke sindu wala kupungusa sindu.<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />“Anajupitii mundu nndota au jojutapusili ndotu pikilanda jinu, kunndagi nu kuhenge nginyuli au ndonduke, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />ana nginyuli heyi au ndonduke hei yeipitila, ndienu jupwaga, ‘Mwiitaputa isapanga yengi nu kuitumaki, isapanga yeyuye ngasemwiimanyike,’ <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />mwanzowanake malobi gaki nndota hoju au jojutapusili indotu, ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jaatumi bombi kundenga mwanganya, ili jumanya mumpala jombi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, kwa mwoju wii woti na kwa loho ji joti. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Mwampwata nu kuntende isima Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nu kupwata malagalaki gaki na kujijetake sauti jaki, mwantumakia nukujongana naku. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Lakini nndota au jojutapusili ndotu hoju mwankoma, kwa ndaba jibia jumboliki kunkana Bambu Sapanga, jojumpiiki ku nndema uku Misili nu kunkombo muutumwa, ili mujileka indela jejuje Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jundagalakia mujipwata. Hela ndi emwikotuka kuhenga ubaja pikilanda jinu.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />“Anajubii nndongu wangu ukinyongo simu, au mwanawaku mwanalomi au mmbomba, au nhwanu waku jogumpala ngani, au nkosi waku jogujongini naku ngani, jwagukolo kwa sili kupwaga, ‘Tuboka tukailumbalia isapanga yengi’, isapanga yeyuye wehapa au akahoku binu ngasebiimanye, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />au isapanga yengi ya bandu baatama pambipi na mwanganya, au isapanga ya bandu baatama kutali kuhumi upandi gumu gu nndema mbaka upandi gongi, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />wiijetake kugukolo, wala wanzowane au kumbone ikia, wala waandekake wala wanhia, <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />ila pe wankoma. Wehapa wibiya ukutumbuli kunkoma, na bandu bangi boti biipwata. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Mwandapula malibu mbaka kuwa! Ndaba julengikiki kugukoloa gubia kutali na Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, jojugupia kuutumwa ku nndema uku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Ndienu, bandu boti Aizalaeli bijowana nukujogopa, na ngabilengi kabee hata kidogu kuhenga ubaja ngati hogu.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />“Pamwiitama mu misi jejuje Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jutenda kumpekee, pengi mwiitenda kujowana, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />kuba bandu bangi angukuna pikilanda jinu, baakolwi bandu buku musi kupwaga, ‘Tubokania tukailumbalia isapanga yengi,’ isapanga yeyuye ngasenhwaiki kuimanya, <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />ndienu mwiilalukia nukutaputa sukulingali sapi, ana sakaka lijambu heli lukusukisa lihengikiki pi kilanda jinu, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />ndi kupalika kwaakoma kwa ngondu bandu ba musi hogu nu kukoma ng'ombi yabu yoti kwa ngondu. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Mwaikusanya hindu yoti ya bandu baatama mu musi hogu nukuileta pikilanda julubanza lwa musi palongi ja bandu boha nukujosa mwotu, ngati litambiku lukutinia kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, musi hogu wibia na mang'oba gingi masoba ganga na mwisu, na wombi ngabagusengi kabete. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Mwaakijuku sindu sokapi sekipikiwi ili kutiniwa, ili Bambu Sapanga jijileka inyela jaki ingali, jundangi kundekake mahakau nu kumbone ikia, nu kunhenga mmbia mwa bingi ngani ngati ejalagila akahoku binu, <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />ngati pe mwajijowania sauti jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ana nkamwi mihilu jaki joti jejumpeke lelenu, nukuhenga gagapalika palongi jaki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Kulobanake kokukanakiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />“Mwanganya ndi mwabana baka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, mwalilembe wala kumoga lupanza kwa ndaba ja mundu jojuwii. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Mwanganya ndi mwabandu ba Sapi kuka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, Bambu Sapanga junhagwii ili mbia mwa bandu baki, kati ja bandu boti ba atama pu nndema.”<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyama yeijetakewa kula na yeakanaki kula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Alawi 11:1-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />“Mwiikula sindu sesuse Sapanga jukaniki mwiikula. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Nhwesa kula inyama aye ng'ombi na makondoo ni imbui, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />mbalapi na swala na holoku ngolongu na holoku huu ni kinyama sebikikema pofu na mbonzu ni imbui yu mwiitombi, <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />na kila kinyama sekibaganiki kwatu yaki mala pa beli na sekibaku, hesi nhwesa kula. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Lakini mwiikula kinyama sokapi sesuse kwatu yaki ngaseibaganiki pandu pabeli na ngasekibakula, mwiikula kinyama sebikikema ngamia wala kipesa wala lingusila, hata ngati itenda kubakula lakini ngase ibaganiki kwatu yaki pandu pabele, ndaba hei yanhenga mwiijetakalewa palongi jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Kabee mwiikula ligolobi hata ngati kwatu yaki ibaganiki pandu pabeli, lakini ngase libakula hei yanhenga mwiijetakewa palongi jaka Sapanga, mwiikula inyama yabu wala kugusa mituhi jabu.”<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />Nhwesa kula kila aina ja homba yeibi ni mipeepe na magamba. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Lakini sindu sokapi sekitama mu masi sanga ni mipeepe wala magamba mwiikula, ndaba hei yanhenga mwijetakewa palongi jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />“Nhwesa kula kila aina ji ijuni yeijetakewa kula. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Lakini mwiikula ijuni aye Limbanga likolongu ni kijuni sebikikema kipungu, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />ijuni yebiikema kengewa na kozi na mambanga goti kwa aina jabu, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />makongoo goti kwi mitindu jaki, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />mbuni ni kihomba nandela ni kipanga kwa aina jabu, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />litungutu lisoku ni litungutu likolongu, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />ijuni yebiikema mwali na ndeli na mnandi, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />ijuni yeibii ni milomu milasu yebiikema membe na koikoi kwa aina yaki na hudihudi na sanima. <verse eid="DEU 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Na hindu yoti isokuisoku yeibii na mapapati yeihomba kwa makundi yanga kujetakeka kwaka Bambu Sapanga mwanganya mwiikula. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Nhwesa kula iumbi yoti yeibi na mapapati yeijetakewa kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />Mwiikula kinyama sokapi sekiwii seni, nhwesa kumpeke nngeni jojutama mu misi jinu jukula, au nhwesa kundombase mundu ju nndema gongi, ndaba mwanganya ndi mwa Sapi kwaka Sapanga, na Bambu Sapanga ndi Sapanga winu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Mwiiteleka katoli ki imbui mu masiba ga anyongo.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilu jukupia litambiku la pandu pa komi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />Mwiipia pandu pamu kati ja komi pi ilebi yii yoti yumu migonda kila saka. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Kabee mwiijenda pandu papupe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jupahagwi kwilibeka liina laki, na pamwiibiya palongi jaki mwiikula matambiku ga pandu pa komi pi ilebi yinu, na ya divai yinu na yamahuta, na yiinyama yukutumbuli ya ng'ombi na makondoo ginu, nhenga hela ili mwilibola kuntende isimu Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu kambelikambeli. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Ngati ana pandu hapu pajuhagwi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, pandu pajupasagwi pabii kutali ngani nu kunyumba jinu, nanamu ngasenhwesa kutoto pandu pakomi ji ilebi yinu yeyuye Bambu Sapanga jutei kumpenge ndienu mwiihenga ana, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />“Ndombisa ilebi yinu nukuitoto hela heyi mbaka pandu Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, pajupasagwi, <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Mwaihengila hela hiyi sindu sokapi semwiipala, inyama ja ng'ombi na jilikondoo, divai au sindu sakunywa sekibaba, mwiikula nukuhekale palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, pamu na akalongu binu. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Mwaajewa bandu Alawi baatama pikilanda jinu, ndaba ngasebaapeke pandu pukutama wala pandu pukulisi pikilanda jino. <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Kila mwisu wa saka sa tatu mwiipiya pandu pa komi yi ilebi yinu yoti nukuibeka mwiikoku mu misi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Heyi yibiya kwa ndaba ja bandu Alawi, ndaba ngaseabii ni lipungu wala kunndeke hindu yaki mweni pikilanda jinu, ageni na akeba na ambabi baatama mu misi jino, biihikania kula nukutupi. Mwiihenga hela na Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jumpengila mu mahengu ginu gowa ganhenga kwa maboku ginu.”<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Saka Sukupomulela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Alawi 25:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />“Kila mwisu wa saka sa saba mwaalekakiya boti bamwaalaja. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Mwiihenga ana, kila jumu winu jojunkopisi nzilani waki, jiliputa lideni heli, wala jilenga kundaja ndaba Bambu Sapanga mweni juamwii lideni heli liputika. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Nhwesa kwaalaja ageni, lakini madeni goti gaalongu binu Aizilaeli mwagaputa.<verse eid="DEU 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />“Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jwiitenda kumpenge mu nndema gojumpekee gubia mali ginu. Nga hata jumu jojibiya kapuku pikilanda jino, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />ila pe mwampwata Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, sukupwata mihilu jenumpeke lelenu. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jampengila ngati ejundagila. Nanamu mwaakopisa bandu bi milema jengi lakini mwanganya ngamwiikopi. Mwaalongusa bandu bi milema jingi, lakini bandu bi milema heji gabanndongosi mwanganya.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />“Kati ja alongu binu anajubii kapuku mu misi ju nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga jiitenda kumpeke mwiikuba mwabimi mwanzangatiyaje. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Lakini gubiya wa mboni nu kunkopesa sukupala mwabee sindu sokapi sejukipala. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Mwilihangalia liwasu libaja lijingi mu mioju jinu, nukulipwagi, ‘Saka sa saba sukulekake madeni kibii pambipi’, wiilangi kuba na mawasu mabaja kuku ndongu waku kapuku nu kusindwa kumpeke sokapi, jombi juwesa kundele Bambu Sapanga kwa ndaba jinu na heli likuba mahakau kwinu. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Mumpekia nndongu winu kapuku kwiisima sanga kuba ni kihenge mu mwoju, ndaba ja haga, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jiitenda kumpenge mu mahengu ginu goti na mu kila sindu senhenga. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Ndaba anhagu ngakukosa mu nndema jinu, ndienu nunndagalaki, mmbiya ni isima kwa akalongu binu ahagu mu nndema winu.<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hempalika kwaahenge atumwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 21:1-11">Kuboka 21:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />“Ana nndongu waku Nhebulania, mwanalomi au mmbomba, anabundombisi kwaku, jaguhengila lihengu kwa yaka sita, lakini mu saka sa saba, wandekakia. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Nawe pawandekakia, waanndeka jubuja maboku matopu. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Wampekia kwa moju ukupala sindu sejugupengi Bambu Sapanga, makondoo au ilebi au divai. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Nkombuka mwanganya mwabii mwatumwa ku nndema uku Misili na Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jatenda kunkombo ndi mana mbaka lelenu nundagalaki hela. <verse eid="DEU 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />Ila anajugupwagi, ‘Ngamoki kwaku,’ ndaba jugupai wehapa na alongu baku na jupala kutama na wehapa, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />ndienu, wiijukua lukombu nukuhoto mulikutu laki mbaka kisomasoma hesi kijingala mundyangu na jombi jibiya ntumwa waku yaka yoti. Ahelahe wantendila ntumwa waku mmbomba. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Wala wiibona tabu kunndekake ntumwa waku, ndaba jukutumaki kwa yaka sita kwa nusu ja malepu gagapalika kulepwa atumisi baahenga lihengu. Henga hela na jombi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku jagupengila kwa kila sindu sewihenga.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibeleku yukutumbuli ya ng'ombi na makondoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />“Wampikia Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, ibeleku yoti yukutumbuli mu makundi ga makambaku ga ng'ombi na makondoo. Waihengesa mahengu ng'ombi heyi wala makondoo haga wala wagaseku mangoma. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Kila saka, wehapa na akalongu baku mwiikula inyama heyi palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, pandu pajapahagwi Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Ila kinyama hesi anakibii na kasolu jokapi, kikubi kilema au sekisindwa kulinga, au kasolu jokapi ngolongu, wakiipiya kuba litambiku kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Mwakikula kinyama sa namuna heji anagubii ku musi waku, kabee inyama yoti yeibii sapi na yeibii ipija guwesa kula ngati egukula holoku au kinyama sebikikema mbalapi. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Lakini wiikula mwai waki, ila pe wagujitala pai ngati masi.”<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">Matola ga Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Kuboka 12:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />Mwiihenga matola ga Pasaka mwei wa Abibu kwiisima yaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. Ndaba mwei wa Abibu hogu Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jumpia mu nndema uku Misili kipindi si ikilu. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Mwiipiya litambiku la Pasaka kuhuma mu makundi ginu gi mipugu ja makondoo au ng'ombi kwiisima yaka Bambu Sapanga, pandu papupe Bambu Sapanga pajupahagwi ili kuntende isima hoku. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Mwiikula litambiku heli na mabumunda gaajegi amila. Kwa masoba saba mwiikula mabumunda ganga kujege amila, na mabumunda haga ndi bagakema mabumunda gamang'aliku ndaba mwaboka ku nndema uku Misili kanyata, ndienu masoba goti gamwiitama mwalikombuka lisoba le mwaboka ku nndema uku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Kwa masoba saba mundu jokapi mu nndema winu jwiibeka amila mu nyumba jaki, ni inyama ji kinyama sejusinziki pakamii ji lisoba lu kutumbuli jiihigali mbaka pulukela. <verse eid="DEU 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />Mwiipia hata kulenga litambiku la Pasaka mu musi waku wokapi gojugupeki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />ila pe mwalipiikia pandu pajwapahagula Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ili kunndumbali, hapa ndi pamwiipikia litambiku la Pasaka pakamii, lyoba palijingii, kipindi selase pamwaboka ku nndema uku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Inyama heji mwajitelaka na kujilele pandu pajapasagula Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu na pulukela jaki mwiikelabuka mu mahema ginu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Masoba sita mwikula mabumunda ganga kujege amila, na lisoba la saba wiibiya nkutanu nkolongu gukundumbali Bambu Sapanga na mwiihenga lihengu lokapi lisoba heli.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matola gu Kuhusa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:22">Kuboka 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Alawi 23:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />“Mwiibalanga majuma saba tumbuka pantumbuli kuhusa ilebi yinu. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Ndienu mwiienga tipati ja majuma kwi isima jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, sukupia litambiku sukupala mwabee, kadili Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ejumpengi. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Mwiitoguliya palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. Mwanganya pamu na bana binu na akakamwali binu na atumisi binu na Alawi na ageni na akeba na akambomba baawii akalomi babu baatama pamu na mwanganya. Nhenga haga pandu Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, pajwiihagula litama ili kunndumbali. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Nkombuka kubanga mwabii mwaatumwa ku nnndema uku Misili, ndienu nhangaliya kujipwata mihilu aje.”<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matola gi indamba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Alawi 23:33-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />“Emwiibiya mpetiki ilebi yii yoti nu kuminya zabibu yinu, mwiihenga Matola gi Indamba kwa masoba saba. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Mwiihenga tipati heji, mwanganya na bana binu akanalomi na akambomba, atumisi binu na aka Alawi na ageni, akeba na akambomba bawii akalomi babu baatama mu misi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Kwa masoba saba mwanhengila tipati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, pandu pajapasagula ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jitenda kumpenge kwiilebi yii yoti na mu mahengu gini goti nanamu mwiitenda kutoguliya.”<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />“Akanalomi boti bu nndema winu biihika palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, mala patatu kila saka pandu pajwapahagula ili kunndumbali, kipindi sa Matola ga Mabumunda ganga kujege amila na Matola gu Kuhusa na Matola gi indamba. Mwiijenda palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga maboku matopu. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Boti biipiya kulengana Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ejumpengi kuba na hindu.”<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutemu ngati ekupalika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />“Mwaahagula bandu bukutemu na akakilongosi kuhuma mu makabila ginu mu misi jinu jejuje Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jampekia na bombi baatemula bandu sanga kupendalela. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Mwanhenga mundu jukosa sindu sejupalika kupata, mwiipendale wala mwiijetake kujopa hongu, kwa ndaba hongu jihenga bandu baabi na malangu biiwesa kutemu ngati ekupalika isoli magambu ga bandu baamboni. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Mwaatemula bandu ngati ekupalika, ili mwiiwesa kutama nu kugujuku nndema gubiya winu gojumpeke Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu.”<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />“Mwiijemeka nkongu wokapi kuba lupendi lwi isapanga yi isoli Ashela pambipi na mesa ju kupiki litambiku jemwansengila Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Wala mwiijemeka lupendi lwi kisapanga sengi lolulwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku jitenda kulusuki.”<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />“Mwampiiki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, litambiku la ng'ombi au lilikondoo lelibi na dosali au lelibi nu ubaja wokapi, ndaba heli liibia sindu sukusukisa kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu.”<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />“Anamunnzowini kubanga mu misi jinu jubii mwanalomi au mmbomba jojuhenga ubaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nukutunu lilaganu laki, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />najombi jupiti kuitumaki isapanga yengi nukuilumbali, nukulilumbali mbaka lyoba, au mwei au hindu yengi yukunani yeyuye ngasenalagalaki mwiilumbalia, <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />anabumpwagi majambu haga, ndi kupalika kulaluki ngani, ana ngati kubii sakaka kubanga majambu mabaja aga gahengiki mu nndema uku Izalaeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />ndienu, mumpiya mundu hoju kunza ja misi nukundapu malibu mbaka jukuwa. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Ila mundu hoju jikomika ngati anaabi babajowini nu kummbona abeli au atatu. Jikomeka ngati ana jubii mundu jumu pena jojujowini nukubona. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Baajowana nukumbona bala ndi babitumbulia kundapu, na bangi kabee bandapula kwa malibu. Hela ndi emwaguhenga ubaja gukotuka pikilanda jinu.” <verse eid="DEU 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />Ana kupiti magambu makolongu mu misi jinu, ngati magambu gagalandi kujetakewa au kukanaliwa palongi jaka Sapanga majambu gagapalika kwaahenge bandu na bandu kuhumisana nu kukoma sa nauli au kukoma sanga nauli. Anakupiti hela, mwiiboka nukujenda pandu pajupahagwi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />na hoku mwiijenda kwaka agolu Alawi, na jojutemu jojubii mulihengu masoba haga, nanamu mwiilandila magambu palongi jabu, na bombi biitenda kutemu. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Ndienu mwiihenga ngati ebampwagila pandu pajanhaguliya Bambu, Mwilingaliya kuhenga goti ngati eanndagalakia. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Mwiipalika kuhenga kulengana nu ulongosi gobampwagila nu kutemu kobampwagila kwinu. Mwiikotoka kutemu kobibiya bundandi. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Mundu jojisindwa kunzetake nngolu au jojutemu jobumbei pala kwa ndaba jukuhenga mahengu gaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, mundu hoju jiitenda kukomeka. Hela ndi emwaguhenga ubaja wiipiti kabe pikilanda jinu. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Bandu boti biitenda kujowana nukujogopa kuhenga kabee sindu sanga lujogopu.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagalaki kupete bambu nkolongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />“Emwiibiya nzingii mu nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jutenda kumpeke gubia winu nukutama homu, nanamu mwapwaaga, ‘Tumbeka bambu nkolongu pikilanda jitu, ngati bandu bi milema joti babutuyongalota,’ <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />nhwesa kumbeka bambu nkolongu pikilanda jinu mundu we hoju Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jwiitenda kunhagu. Mwanmbeka jumu kati ja alongu binu kuba bambu nkolongu pikilanda na mundu wehoju jubiya juku Izilaeli. Mwanhenga mundu jwanga Nhizilaeli kuba bambu nkolongu pikilanda jinu. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Hata hela jikuba ni inyama yingi yebiikema falasi kwa ndaba jaki mweni, wala jwaakelabu bandu ku nndema uku Misili ili kupwata inyama yebiikema falasi, kwa ndaba Bambu Sapanga jundakali, ‘Mwiilenga nabwaka kukelabuki hoku kabee.’ <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Wala jiijuku akambomba bingi, anajutei hela mwoju waki wihobangana, wala jalibeke madini ga feza na zahabu hingi ngani. <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Pabanhimika kuba bambu ukolongu kupalika juliandakiya kabee kitabu si mihilu kwa ndaba jaki mweni kuhuma mu kitabu seatunza agolu Alawi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Kitabu hesi jibiya nasu nu kukisoma masoba goti mu womi waki woti, ili juwesa kulibola kuntende isima Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waki, jukamula nukuhenga malobi goti ga gi mihilu jenze na malagalaki ganga <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />sanga kulikwea mweni kwaka alongu baki, wala kubeka pulutengu nhilu ago kwa namuna jokapi, ili juwesa kuendele kulongosa jwombi pamu ni ibeleku yaki mu nndema uku Izalaeli.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Seapalika kupata Agolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />“Agolu boti Alawi, babube ndi likabila loti la Alawi nga biikubi na pandu wala kwaapeke pandu punndema pabiya pabu mu nndema uku Izalaeli. Bombi biikula pandu pi litambiku laka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Wala nga biikubi nu nndema wabu kati ja alongu babu, Bambu Sapanga ndi lipungu labu ngati ejalagila.”<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />“Heli ndi libia lipungu la Akagolu kuhuma kwa bandu babiipiya litambiku la ng'ombi au lilikondoo, baampekea agolu kugolu kukulongi ni inyama jikimutu nu utumbu. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Mwaapekia pandu pukutumbuli pi ilebi yinu na divai na mahuta ginu na mangoma gukutumbuli ga makondoo ginu. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Mu makabila ginu goti, Bambu Sapanga jilihagwi likabila la Lawi luntumakia ngati agolu masoba goa ganga na mwisu.”<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />“Ana Ndawi jokapi sukupala mweni juwesa kuboka mu musi wokapi gola gwa Aizalaeli nukujenda pandu pala Bambu Sapanga pajupasagwi, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />ndi juwesa kuhenga lihengu ngati nngolu waka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waki, ngati Alawi bangi bala baahenga mahengu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Biipata mapungu gabu gagalengana na bangi, hata ngati abi na mali kupete hindu yealombesa alongu babu.”<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhenga mahengu gagasukisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />“Emwiihika mu nndema gola goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jwampekia, mwiijiga kuhenga mahengu mabaja ga bandu baatama mu milema heji. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Jwiikuba mundu jokapi pikilanda jinu jojantinia mwanamundu mwanalomi au mmbomba pa mwotu, wala jojulondola wala jojulinga ipindi, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />wala nhabi wala joannzambaki nzaki sukukonga muhundu, wala jojukemale majini, wala jojaagungamali bandu baakuwiki wala jojaaloba bandu baawii. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Mundu jokapi jojuhenga mahengu ngati haga ndi ansukisa Bambu Sapanga na kwa ndaba ja majambu haga gukusukisa, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jaabenga bandu ba namuna heji palongi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Mwiikuba na makosa sukuhenga majambu gagunsukisa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu.”<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilagi lukunndeta nndota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />“Bandu bi milema aje bamwaabenga baajowanee ngani baahenga majambu gikihabi nu kulondoo, lakini Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ngasejunzetake mwanganya nhenga hela.”<verse eid="DEU 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />“Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jandetila nndota jojubi ngati nepani kuhuma pikilanda jinu, na mwanganya mwanzowania hoju.” <verse eid="DEU 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />“Hesi ndi senundoba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ku Holebu kola, lisoba lela pamwaketangana nu kupwaga, ‘Twiijowanake kabee sauti kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, wala twagubona kabee mwotu nkolongu ago, ili twiikuwa!’ <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Najombi Bambu Sapanga jambwagila, Alongi sakaka. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Nanhagulia nndota ngati wehapa kuhuma pikilanda ja alongu babu, nagajegala malobi gangu mu nndomu waki, na jombi janndandila goti gananndagalakia. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Jokapi jola jwanga kujowane malobi gajwiilongila nndota jola, nepani na mweti nitenda kundapula. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Lakini nndota jokapi jojwiipwaga kubanga jujopiki malobi kuhuma kwangu nepani naakati nepani ngasenumpwagi sindu au ndota jojwiipwapa kwi liina liisapanga yengi kupalika jukomika.”<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />“Lakini mwanganya nhwesa kupwaga, ‘Twiiwesa bole kulimanya lilobi langa kulonge Bambu Sapanga?’ <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Ana nndota jupwagiki sindu kwi lihina laka Bambu Sapanga na sindu hesi ngasekihengiki au ngase kikuba sakaka, lijambu heli ngasejupwagiki Bambu Sapanga, nndota jupwagiki sukumanya mwene, nanamu mwiijogopa kwa ndaba ji lijambu heli.”<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Misi jukutili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Esabu 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Joshua 20:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />“Kipindi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ejiibiya jaakomiki bandu bu nndema gola goguwe jumpekee mwanganya na pamwiibiya mugukamwi nu kutama mu manyumba gabu, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />ndienu mwajitenga misi mitatu mu nndema gojampekia Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, gubia winu. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Kupalika kugubagana ndema jejampekia gojumpeke Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu pandu patatu, ndi nhagula musi gumu mu kilapandu gukutili. Mwilenganake indela ili bandu awesa kuhika hoku mu kila musi bila tabu. Ili mundu ana jukomiki nzaki juwesa kutili mu musi gumu kati ja misi je heji jubia mwomi. <verse eid="DEU 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Mundu anajunkomiki nzaki sanga nauli, na jombi ngasejwabii mmbaja waki, juwesa kutili mu musi gumu kati ja misi mitatu heji, juwesa kuba mwomi. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Tupwaga, mundu jojuwesa kujenda kukiholi nu nnzaki kutinya hanzu na jwombi kipindi sejuseku nkongu, libagu liwesa kuhopoka mu saka saki, nukunkoma nzaki jola, mundu hoju juwesa kutili mu musi gumu kati ji mitatu heji, ili juwesa kulama. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Lakini ana kwakabii na musi gumu pe na wabii kutali, jojulepesa kisasi hoju ndaba jiinyela juwesa kumpwatali nu kunkamu nu kunkoma mundu hoju jojunhengiki nnzaki jukuwa, hata ngati ngasebuntemwi kukomeka na abeli haba ngasebabii nu ubaja wokapi pamwandi! <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Kwa ndaba heji nundagalaki ntenga misi jitatu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />“Kabee ngati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jwipanua mipaka ju nndema winu, ngati ejalapila akahoku binu, na jwombi jampekia nndema woti gojaalagila kwaapeke akahoku binu haba, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />Ana nhangali nu kupwata mihilu aje joti jenundagalaki lelenu, nukumpala Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nukujipwata masoba goti indela jaki, ndienu, mwiijonzukia kabee misi jengi mitatu, <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />ili mundu jwanga nu ubaja jiikomeka mu nndema winu goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jwampekia gubiya winu ili bandu biikuba na lawama juku kukoma.”<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />“Lakini anamundu jubii nu ubaja nu nnzaki, na juhamu kuhepale nukukoma, alapu jutili kati ja musi gumu kati ja misi heji, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />pala ndi aseja ba musi hogu baatuma bandu bu mpiya hoku nukukabisi kuka mundu jojulepesa kisasi kwa ndaba jukukoma. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Mwaambone ikia, ila mwaguhenga ubaja gukukoma mundu jwanga nu ubaja gujomuka mu nndema uku Izalaeli, ili nhwesa kutama su lukwali.”<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mipaka japa mwandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />“Wiiboa lilibu lu mpaka wa bapambipi baku, goguwe bugubekiki pa mwandi mu nndema gojwampekia Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu gubia winu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagalaki kwa babagajowana nukugabona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />“Mundu jumu jojujowini nukubona likosa laka mundu ngajwiitosi mundu hoju kunzowane kajika ili mundu jojuhengiki makosa kutemuliwa. Ndi kupalika abia bandu abeli au atatu baabweni nukujowana ndi baapalika kwaajowane ili kutemu. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Anajubii jojupwaga isoli kubanga ambweni nu kunzowane mundu jokapi kupete likosa lokapi, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />ndienu jwombi na jojuntaki jola ndi biijenda pandu pukunndumbali Bambu Sapanga, palongi jaka Agolu na baatemu bababii mu lihengu kipindi hesi, <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />baatemu balisungusa sukulihangali ligambu heli ana mundu jojugabweni nu kugajowana julongiisoli antaki nzaki kwiisoli, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />ndienu mwanhengila ngati ejwapala kunhenge nndongu waki. Hela ndi emwaguhenga ubaja ukotuka pikilanda jinu. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Na bombi bandu bangi biijowana nukujogopa, nu ubaja ngati ago ngagwiihengeki kabee kwinu. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Mwaabonee ikia bandu ba namuna heji. Azabu jabu jiibia womi wiilepika kwa womi na liu kwa liu na linu kwalinu na kuboku sukuboku nu kugolu sukugolu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Kujenda kungondu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />“Anampiti kungondu kukomana na akaabaja binu nu kuibona inyama yebiikema falasi na magali na akomana ngondu bingi ngani kuliku binu mwaajogopa. Ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jojumpiya kundema uku Misili, jibiya pamu na mwanganya. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Kabula jukutumbuli kukomana, nngolu jipitila palongo nakwapwagi akomana ngondu, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />‘Mwaakomana ngondu buku Izalaeli nzowania! Lelenu nzenda kungondu kukomana na akabaja baku. Mwiihola mu mioju jinu, wala mwiijogopa, au kuntisa, au kwaajogopa abaja binu, <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jiijenda na mwanganya kunkomane kwa akabaja binu nukunhenga mwaawesa.’”<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />“Akakilongosi baapwagila bandu, ‘Jubii mundu jokapi pamba jojusengiki nyumba inyai lakini ngasejuwaiki kunkabisi Sapanga jujilendaje? Jukelubuka kunyumba ili jiiwele kungondu na mundu jongi jijenda kutama nkati jaki. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Boo, jubii mundu jokapi pamba jojupandiki mizabibu na ngase jutumbuli kula matunda gaki gukutumbuli? Jukelabuka kunyumba jiwele kungondu na mundu jongi kutumbuli kula matunda gaki. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Boo, jubii mwanalomi jokapi pamba jojusumbi nukupia mali na jubii pambipi kujuku mmbomba? Jukelabuka kunyumba jwiiwele kungondu, na mwanalomi jongi kunzuku nsumba waki.’” <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />“Akakilongosi biiendalia kwaalaluki bandu, ‘Boo, jubii pamba mundu jojubii nulujogopu mu mwoju jake? Jukelabuka kunyumba ndaba juwesa kwaahenga ajaki abiya nulujogopu mu mioju jabu ngati jwombi.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Akaakilongosi ebibiya ajomuli kulonge na bandu, ndienu akalonda baalongua bandu.”<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />“Kipindi pamwiijenda kukoma na bandu ba musi, ntumbulia kwaalaluki ana abii tayali kukomana au ngaseabi tayali. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Bandu ba musi hogu anaapai lukwali nukulibeka mu ulongosi winu, ndienu bandu boti babii homu biitenda kuntumaki nu kuhenga mahengu gaganonwipi sakwaalasimisa. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Lakini ana bandu ba musi hogu ngaseapai lukwali na mwanganya, nukukomana ngondu na mwanganya, ndienu mwaguyongulata musi wabu, <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />na Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jaahenga mwaawesa na mwaakoma ku upanga akanalomi boti, <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />lakini akambomba na bana, ng'ombi na hindu yoti yeibii mu musi, nhwesa kujukuu yemwiikamwi kwa ndaba jinu mwabete, nanamu nhwesa kutumi hindu heyi yeyuye Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jutei kumpeke. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Hela ndi emwaahengila bandu ba misi joti jejibi kutali nu nndema gowibiya gwinu.” <verse eid="DEU 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />Lakini mu misi ju nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jutei kumpekea, mwaakoma bandu boti ni inyama yoti. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Mwaakoma tipitipi bandu boti Ahiti na Aamoli na Akanani na Apelizi na Ahivi na Ayebusi ngati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ejunndagalakia, <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />ana ngamwiihengi hela bombi bammbola mwanganya kuhenga mahengu goti gukusukisa gaguge biihenge isapanga yabu, nanamu mwiibia munhengi mahakau kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />“Kipindi pamwaguyongalota musi sukukomana ngondu kwi kipindi kilasu, ili kugukamu mwiipengula mikongu ja matunda kwa mapengu, ndaba mwiiwesa kula matunda gaki. Boo, mikongu le ndi bando mbaka mujilapulaje? Nhwesa kula matunda gi mikongu heji ila mwiiseku. <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Hata hela nhwesa kuseku mikongu jengi janga ja matunda ili kutumi kugukamuli musi.”<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Nhilu gogulandi bandu baakoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />“Anajupatikini mundu joankomiki kwikiholi mu nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jutei kumpeke gubia gwinu, nanamu ngase mummanyiki nya jojunkomiki, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />akakilongosi na bandu bi baatemu biipita nukujenda kupema ulasu waki kuboke pandu pagubii ntuhi hogu mbaka pa misi ja pambipi. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Ndienu, akakilongosi ba musi gola gogubi pambipi nu ntuhi gola biijukuwa litoli la ng'ombi lelule ngaselihengiki lihengu lokapi wala ngasebilikongiki sindu sokapi. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Nabombi balipelika litoli la ng'ombi heli mbaka kuligomba kukalosi kakuke ngasekajomalela, ni ligomba heli ngasealema wala ngaseapanda sindu, na hoku balitunula hingu litoli la ng'ombi heli. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Na akagolu kuhuma mu likabila la Lawi biipalika abiya pala. Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jwaahagula bunhengila mahengu gaki nukunndoba Sapanga jwaapengila bandu baki. Bombi kabee ndi babii nu uwesu gogulandi kila sindu nu kutumii makili. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Litoli la ng'ombi lela pamwalitunula nhingu, akakilongosi boti ba musi hogu gogubi pambipi na mundu joankomiki, biisamba masi mumaboku gabu panani ja ng'ombi jebilitunula nhingu jaki heji, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />nu kupwaga, ‘Ngasetuhengiki sindu senze wala ngasetumanyiki joankomiki. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, waalekakiya bandu baku Aizilaeli bawakombula kuhuma ku Misili, waabeka bandu baku mu kihakau sukukomeka kwaka mundu jwanga ni kihakau, ila utulekakiya twepani kihakau situ na watubona ngati tubii ni kihakau kupete lijambu lukunkoma mundu hoju.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Henu mwibiya mlinyambisi mwabeti kupete kihakau hesi, sukuhenga hela likosa lukukoma hoku ngalikubi linu, ndaba nhengiki gajugapala Bambu Sapanga nhenga.”<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunzuku mmbomba jobunkamwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />“Anampiti kukomana ngondu na abaja binu, na jombi Bambu Sapanga kuhenga nhwesa, nu kwaajuku baasindiki, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />ana jumu winu abweni mmbomba jwamboni pikilanda ja bandu babakamwi, anajuntokuli nu kupala kunzuku. <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />Ndienu, wa mwanalomi wegumpai, gwanzukua mbaka kunyumba jaku, na jombi jimoga kimutu saki nu kuseku yobu yaki, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />jiihula ingobu yejabii juweti pabasindwa. Jwiitama mwei gumu kwaalele atati baki na amabaki, ndienu guwesa kugone naku, na jombi jubiya nhwanu waku. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Lakini anangasejugulenganela wandeka jujenda, waandombesa ku lupija wala wanhenga ngati ntumwa, ndaba gupoiki lihamu.”<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagalaki kwaka mwana jojutumbuli kubelekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />“Ana mwanalomi jongi jubii ni mitala na jombi jumpala jumu kupeta jongi. Na akambomba haba bumpapi bana akanalomi, na mwana jukutumbuli kubeleka ndi jukanyongo jwanga kumpala jola, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />analihika lisoba anajwiiamu kwaapeke ulisi bana baki, tati hoju jwiilangi kupala kumpeke sukumpeke hindu hingi nakanopi mwana jukummbomba joampai jola. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Ndi kwiipalika anzetake jukutumbuli kusaliwa jola hata ngati ngaseampai mwana juku mbomba jwanga kumpala jola, nu kumpeke haki jaki, pandu pa mali gaki mala pabeli.”<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bana banga kwaajoane akahengo na akanyongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />“Ana jubii na mwana jwanga kwaajoane akahengo na akanyongo hata ngati atenda kunndapu ili kummbola, lakini jwakona ngasejwaajoane, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />ndienu, amabu na atati baka mwana hoju baanzukua mbaka pi litanga la musi ili kuntaki kwa akakilongosi. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Ahengo na anyongo haba baapwagila akakilongosi ba musi, ‘Mwana witu jubii ni kibuli nu ngukuna, ngasejupala kutujowana, jubii nndapi nu nndepi.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Hapa bandu ba musi hogu bandapula kwa malibu mwana hoju mbaka jukuwa. Hela ndi emwaguhenga ubaja gukotuka pikilanda jinu. Kila mundu kati ja bandu ba Aizilaeli jwiijowana lijambu heli nu kujogopa.”<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilu jengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />“Ana mundu juhengiki likosa lelipalika kukomeka najombi anaankomiki sukumbambali mu nkongu, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />ntuhi waki wihigali mu nkongu ikilu joti ila mwagutaga lisoba lele. Ndaba mundu joammbambali munkongu jupatiki yambamba kuhuma kwaka Sapanga nanamu ngamwaguhengi nndema winu gojumpekiya Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, gubiya winu kuba wanga kujetakeka palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />“Ana gwijibwe ng'ombi au likondoo luku nndongu waku litei kuhoba, waileka ila waikelabua kukunndogu waku. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Lakini ngati anakunyumba juku nndongu waku ngase kubii pambipi au ngati ngasegumanyiki mweni, ndienu wijenda naku kinyama hesi kunyumba jaku, wiitama naku mbaka pajwiihika mweni, nawehapa wankelabukia. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Wiihenga helahe kwi liponda au ingobu au sindu sokapi sejuhoiki nndongu waku. Kupalika kunnzangati.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />“Ana gulibweni liponda au ng'ombi juku nndongu waku jihabwiki mwiindela, wiikotoka kunzangatila nndongu waku, wanzangatiya nndongu waku kulitondabea.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />“Akambomba biiwata ingobu yakanalomi na akanalomi biiwata ingobu ikimmbomba. Jojihenga hela sibiya sindu sukusukisa kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />“Ana wikiketani kitundu si kijuni mu nkongu au mwiindela, kibii ni ibana au maombi ni kijuni seni kibii papu kitenda kugajobate, waakijukuu kijuni hesi ni ibana yaki. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Wakileka kijuni hesi kijenda, lakini guwesa kujukuu ibana yaki. Anaguhengiki hela Sapanga jagupengila na wiiwesa kutama masoba gingi.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />“Egwisenga nyumba inyai, gusenga nu lumatu mulutengu ju nhaga, ananga kuhenga hela mundu anajuhabwiki nakuwa jagulelila wehapa. <verse eid="DEU 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />Gwiipanda mimea jengi mu litui laku li mizabibu, ana guhengiki hela ilebi yaku yoti nga ikubi yaku nga matunda gagupandiki pe gala ila kabee matunda gi mizabibu.<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />“Wiilema nngonda sukutumi ng'ombi ni liponda pamu sukukonga kingolingoli simu.<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />“Wiiwata ingobu yealokiki sukutumi mangoma gi inyama na yealokiki kwi migoji ji kitambaa kihuu. <verse eid="DEU 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />Konga mahundu nsesi ga nyusi mu ingobu jaku.”<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagalaki ga ndou</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />“Ana mwanalomi anajuntoi mmbomba nukugone naku, na mwenikatai jupala kunndeka, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />koni junkopaki nu kunkema liina lilihaa kupwaga, Nuntola mmbomba ajo, lakini enagonila naku jabonikana juwaiki kugone na akanalomi jongi.”<verse eid="DEU 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />Ndienu, atati baki na amabaki mmbomba hoju biileta sindu sukulangi kamwali wabu ngasejuwaiki kugone na mwanalomi kwa akikilongosi bi pi litanga la musi nukumpwaga, <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />“Tumpiiki kamwali witu mundu ajoo kuba nhwanu waki, lakini sajenu ngase apai kabete, <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />henu ankopaki kamwali witu kupwaaga kubanga ankoli kamwali witu jubii jojuwaiki kugone na mwanalomi jongi kabula jaki. Hata hela tuletiki ingobu jejilangi kubanga ngasejuwaiki kugone na mwanalomi jongi. Ndienu bajihatambula ingobu jejibii na sindu sekilangi kubanga ngasejuwaiki kugone na mwanalomi palongi ja akakilongosi ba musi. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Akakilongosi ba musi bala ndi banzukua mwanalomi jola nu kundimanga iboku. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Kabee baampwagila julepa ipandi mia jimu ya madini ga feza na kwaapekee atati baka kamwali hoju kwa ndaba mwanalomi hoju anhengiki jubiya ni iyoni kamwali juku Izilaeli. Kamwali hoju jiendalia kuba nhanu waki na ngajiwesi kulekana naku mu kutama kwaki kwoti.” <verse eid="DEU 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Lakini ana magambu haga gabii sakaka, na ngase kibii sindu sekilangi kubanga kamwali hoju ngase juwaiki kugone na mwanalomi jongi, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />bampelika kamwali hoju pi litanga la nyumba ja atati baki na akanalomi ba musi hogu bandapula malibu mbaka kuwa, ndaba juhengiki kihakau mu nndema uku Izilaeli sukuhenga uselati koni jubii kunyumba ja atati baki. Hapa ndi emwakiboa kihakau ngati hesi pikilanda jinu.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />“Ana mwanalomi anabunkamwi ugoni nu nhwanu ukunzaki, boti abeli, mwanalomi nu mmbomba ndi kupalika kwaakoma. Hela ndi emwakiboa kihakau pikilanda jinu.<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />“Ana mwanalomi anketani kumusi kamwali joasumbiki, najombi kujenda kugone naku, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />mwaapiya boti kunza ja musi nukwaalapu kwa malibu mbaka akuwa. Kamwali hoju ndi kupalika bunkoma ndaba ngasejajamali bunzangatia hata ngati jabii ku musi, na mwanalomi hoju ndi kupalika kunkoma kwa ndaba anhengiki nsumba mundu jongi. Sukuhenga hela ndi emwakiboa kihakau pikilanda jinu.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />“Lakini ana mwanalomi juketangini ku kiholi na kamwali joansumbiki nu kunkamu kwa makili, ndienu mwanalomi pena jojipalika kunkoma. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Mwanhengee kamwali hoju sokapi, jombi ngase jubii ni kihakau sekipalika kukomeka. Lihengu laka mwanalomi ndi ngati lihengu lukundapu mundu nukukoma, <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />kwa ndaba mwanalomi hoju ankamula kwa makili kamwali hoju kukiholi hata ngati jajamali ili ahika kunzangati ila ngasejabii mundu jukunzangatila.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />“Ana mwanalomi ankamwi anndimba kamwali jwanga kunsumba, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />Mwanalomi hoju jwaalepa atati buku mmbomba jola ipandi amusini ya madini ga feza ndaba jutei kunndimba nu mmbomba hoju jibia nhwanu waki, wala jwaandeka hata kulenga mu kutama kwaki kwoti ndaba ampoiki liyamu.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />“Mwanalomi jokapi jwiilenga kugone nu nhwanu wa atati baki.<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Kubekwa kutali na bandu baka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />“Mwanalomi jokapi joambotwi au joansekwi lihona laki ngakwiipaliki kujingii mu likundi la bandu baka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Mundu jokapi jojusaliwi kunza ja ndoa ibeleku yaki ngakwiipaliki kujingi mu nsambi waka Bambu Sapanga hata mbaka mu kibeleku sa komi. <verse eid="DEU 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />Aamoni au Amoabu jokapi, ibeleku yabu yoti hata mbaka kibeleku sa komi, ngabiijetakewe kujingi mu likundi la bandu baka Bambu Sapanga, <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />ndaba bakaniki kumpekee posu na masi pamwabii mwiindela kuhuma ku nndema uku Misili, kabee bumpekiya lupija Balamu mwana uka Beoli kuhuma kumusi uku Petoli ku Mesopotania ili kwatende yaambamba. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Lakini Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ngasejunzowani Balamu, jang'anambula yambamba kuba mbenge, ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jutenda kumpala. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Mwiijongana nabu wala kuhenga nabu ukosi nu lukwali mu kutama kwii kwoti.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />“Lakini mwaasuki Aedomu kwa ndaba bombi ndi alongu baku. Waasukila Amisili ndaba watemi ngati gungeni mu nndema waki. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Kibeleku sa tatu sa bana babu babisaliwa kwabu, awesa kujingi mu likundi la bandu baka Sapanga.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulibeka likambi libiya sapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />“Enzenda kungondu nukubeka likambi, kila jumu julihangalia jwiihenga sindu sokapi sesanhenga jubia jwanga kujetakeka palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Ana pikilanda jinu jubii mundu jokapi jojubii jwanga kujetakeka palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga kwa ndaba jukumpita imbeju ikilu, jwiipalika jupita kunza jilikambi nu kutama hoku. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Lakini hekwihika pakamii jwiihoga masi, na lyoba palibia lijingi juwesa kukelabuka kulikambi.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />“Mwapatenga pandu kunza ji likambi pamwiiwesa kujenda kutunda. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Nanamu mwiibiya na kagela kasoku mu hindu yaku, na haka mwiitumia kuhemba libomba kwa ndaba jukuyelale likelu linu. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Likambi linu ndi kwiipalika libiya la sapi, ndaba Bambu Sapanga jujenda pikilanda jinu ili kundenda nukwaabeka abaja binu pai juulongosi winu. Henu mwanndeka jukibona sindu sokapi kipija pikilanda jinu nukuamu kung'anambuka nukundeka.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilu jengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />“Ana ntumwa jutili kwaku wehapa waankelabu kuka bambu waki. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Mundeka jutama pikilanda jinu pandu pokapi pajupapala mu musi wokapi gojagusagula mwambone.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />“Mwiizalaeli jokapi, mwanalomi au mmbomba ngasejupalika hatakulenga kuba ngoni sukujenda kulumbali isapanga yengi. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Lupija lokapi lolupatikana sukuhenga ugoni sukulumbali isapanga yengi, yiipelekwa mu Lihema la Sapi laka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, kulepe sindu segulagi, kwa ndaba mwanalomi au mmbomba jojubii ngoni sukuilumbali isapanga yengi ndi sibiya sindu sukusukisa kwaka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />“Wankopesa nndongu waku Mwiizalaeli sindu kukupala liba, wandepesa liba kwa ndaba ju kukopesa hela au posu au sindu sokapi sesuse bandu akopesa kwa liba. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Guwesa kumpwagi nngeni julepila liba, lakini nndongu waku Mwizalaeli wanndepesa liba, najombi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, jagupengila kwa mahengu gaku goti gawihenga mu nndema gowijenda kutama. <verse eid="DEU 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />Egulagi sindu kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, wiiselawesa kujitimisa ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku jitenda kukulaja, nanagu wibiya na mahakau. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Lakini anagukotwiki kulagi sindu ngawikubi na mahakau. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Ulihangaliya kutimisa sindu segulagi sukulogo pu ndomu waku, ndaba undagi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, sukupala wa mweti.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />“Anagupetiki mungonda ukunzilani waku umizabibu guwesa kula zabibu kadili mogwiwesa, lakini waitongoo zabibu nukuinyege mwikitonga saku. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Ana gupetiki mu ngonda ukunzilani waku gogubii ni ilebi uwesa kutongo ilebi isokopi kukuboku kwaku na kula, lakini wiitola kijipi nukujipa ilebi yaki.<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Kutalikana nu kujuku kabee mmbomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />“Ana mwanalomi jujukwii mmbomba na mwenikatai jubweni ngaseampala ndaba jubweni kuka mmbomba hoju sindu sanga saasapi, henu mmbomba hoju anhandakia likalatasi lu kuntalika ampekia nukummbenga kunyumba jaki ndi mmbomba hoju juboka. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Najombi ana jubokiki panyumba jaki juwesa kujenda nukujukuliwa na mwanalomi jongi. <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />Ana mwanalomi jwapili hoju anzukwi nukunhandaki likalatasi lukutalikana nukumpeke nukummbenga kunyumba jaki au ana mndomi waki hoju jutei kuwa, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />henu mwanalomi jojwatumbulia jola ngasejupalika kabee kunzuku mmbomba jola ndaba bunhengiki kuba jwangakujetakeka palongi jaka Sapanga. Ana juhengiki hela Sapanga jutenda kusuki.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilu jengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />“Mwanalomi jojujukwi mmbomba masoba masokopi gagapetiki kwiijenda kukomana ngondu wala bampeke lihengu lokapi lengi bunndekakia kwa saka simu, ili jutama panyumba nukutogule nu nhwanu waki.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />“Mundu jokapi jwijujuku lilibu la pai au la panani lukuyagi kuba poni, kukuhenga hela kwibiya ngati jujuku womi waka mundu hoju.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />“Mundu jokapi ana anzibiki Nhizilaeli nzaki nu kunhenga kuba ntumwa waki au kunndombesa kuutumwa mundu hoju kupalika jukomika. Sukuhenga hela ndi mwiibiya mmboiki kihakau mu nndema winu.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />“Ana mundu gumpatiki ugonzu gu ukoma kupalika kuangali ngamaa nu kupwata malagalaki ga Alawi. Ngati henunndagalaki ndi hemwiipwata kukulingalaki.<verse eid="DEU 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />“Nkombuka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wii, heanhenga Miliamu hemwabia mwiindela kuhuma ku Misili.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />“Ana ukopisi wapambipi waku sindu sokapi, wiijingi kunyumba jaki kujuku poni. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Unndendalia kunza na gunndeka mweni juguletila poni jeheji. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Ana jombi ndi nhagu wiitama na poni heji ikilu kelukelu. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Unkelabukia kila lisoba pakamii ili ikilu juwesa kuliyekale na kugupengee. Kuhenga hela ndi lijambu laamboni palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wiino.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />“Wanndepa malepu masoku ntumisi nhagu na jojupalika kujangatiwa, jukubi Nhizilaeli au jumu jwaageni baatama mu misi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Kila lisoba kabula lioba ngaselijingi unndepa malepu gaki wilisoba heli, ndaba jombi ndi nhagu na malepu haga ndi mwoju waki juhobale gagaga ili jwiika nukunndele Bambu Sapanga na wehapa wiikuba na mahakau.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />“Akatati na akamabu biikomeka kupete makosa ga bana babo, wala bana biikomeka kupete makosa ga akatati na akamabu babo. Kila mundu jwiikomika kupete makosa gaki mwene.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />“Mwiihenga ngati ekupalika kwaahenge ageni na bana akeba. Wala mwiijuku ingobu yaka mundu joawii alomi baki kuba poni. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Nkombuka mwanganya mwabia mwaatumwa ku nndema uku Misili na Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ankombula kuboka hoku. Henu numpeke lilagalaki hele.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />“Pannhusa ilebi yii kumatui nukujewa ilebi yengi momu, mwiibuja kuholo, mwaalekila ageni na akeba na akambomba baawii alomi babu ili Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wii jaampengila mu mahengu gii goti. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Ana ntongwi zeituni inu, mwikelabuki kutongo mu mambandi mala ja pili ila mwaalekila gani na akeba na akambomba baawii alomi babu. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Hentondo zeituni mwiikelabuki kutondo zeituni yeiigali ila mwaalekila ageni na akeba na akambomba baawii alomi babu. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Nkombuka kubanga mwanganya mwabii mwaatumwa ku nndema Misili, ndienu numpeke malagalaki ganga.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />“Ana gubii ugombi kati jii mwaabeli nukujenda kumagambu najumu ana jubonikana ngasejubii ni likosa na jongi jabonikana jubii na makosa, <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />jojubonakini jubii na makosa, ana buntemwi kundapula iboku jojutemu jwiilagalakia mundu hoju jugoluka pai nu lutumbu nukunndapu iboku kulengana ni likosa laki. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Jojubii ni likosa juwesa kundimanga iboku alubaini lakini hii petake. Ana mpetaki iboku hei mwiibia mumpoiki lihamu nndongu wii.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />“Mwajikonga ng'ombi nndomu pajipumunda ilebi.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sejupalika kuhenga mundu mmbeli waki jojuwii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />“Ana alongu abeli akanalomi atama pamu na jumu wabu ana juwii sanga kunndeka mwana mwanalomi, nhwanu waki jwiijenda kunzuku pandu pangi kunza ji kilongu sengi ila jwiipalika jutoguleka nu nndongu waki jojuhigali. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Mwana ju utumbuli mwanalomi jojwiisaliwa jwiibalangika kuba mwana waka mundu jojuwii jola ili liina laki liiputika mu nndema uku Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Lakini ana nndongu waka mundu jojuwii hoju ngaseampala mmbombo joawii alomi baki hoju ndienu mmbomba hoju jwiijenda palongi jaka kilongosi ba musi nukupwaga, ‘Kaka wa alomi bangu baawii jukana kuendalesa liina laka kaka waki jojuwii mu nndema uku Izilaeli, ngasejupai kuhenge gagapalika kuhenga kwa ndaba juku nndomi wangu jojuwii.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Ndi akakilongosi ba musi bankema mwanalomi hoju nukulonge naku. Ana jwiiendalia kupwaga ngasejupai kunnzuku, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />Mmbomba joawii alomi baki hoju jwanzendila palongi ja aseja bamusi aba, anhula kilatu saki simu nukunhuni imata pamiu nukumpwagi, ‘Hela ndi hekupalika kuhengewa mundu jojukana kumpeke nndongu jojuwii kibeleku.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Nilihina la nyumba jaki pa Izilaeli liitenda kumanyikana ngati, ‘Nyumba jaka mundu jobunhuliki kilatu.’”<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagalaki gangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />“Akanalomi abeli ana akomini nu nhwanu waka jumu wabu ana anzangati nndomi waki sukunkamu pi lihona jujukomana nu nndomi waki jola, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />mwambone ikia, mwansekula kuboku kwa malele kuka mmbomba hoju.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />“Waakonga bandu pagupema hindu sukutumii malibu mabeli. Lengi lelitopiki na lengi lelijojwiki. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Wala mwiikuba na aina ibeli yiipemu yukupeme mu nyumba jaku, simu kikolongu na sengi kisoku.<verse eid="DEU 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />“Ntumia ipemu yeibii nu utopee wa sakaka ili nhwesa kutama yaka ingipi mu nndema gojumpeke Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Boti baahenga majambu haga, kwiisoli Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wii jutenda kwaasuki.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilu ja kwaakoma Ahamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />“Nkombuka sebahenga Ahamaleki pamwabia mwiindela kuhuma ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Ahamaleki haba ngasebunzogupa Sapanga. Ndienu bundapula kuhuma munyuma koni nsokiki na kujokane makili kabee baalapula bandu bababiya ahuma munyuma. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Henu kipindi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu pajwanhenga mmbiya mwabomi kwa ndaba jukulapuliwa na abaja binu boti babaayongalota mu nndema gojumpeki gubia winu nu kutama momu, kupalika mwaakoma tipitipi Ahamaleki boti biibonikana kabee.<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Matambiku gi hindu gaahusiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />“Pamwiijingala nndema jejuje Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wii jumpeke kujilisa na pamwiikuba mujijukwii nukutama nkati jaki, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />nzukua ilebi yengi yu utumbuli yenhusiki ya indu yoti yemwibia mpandiki mu luombi wa nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga jutei kumpeke mu kitonga. Ndi wiijenda naku mbaka pandu pajupahagwi Sapanga ili kunndumbali jombi. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Wannzendila nngolu waka Sapanga jojuhenga lihengu kipindi hesi nukumpwagi. ‘Lelenu nyetake palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wangu, kubanga nyingi mu nndema goguwe Sapanga jwaalapila akahoku bitu kupwaga jwiitenda kutupeke.’<verse eid="DEU 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />“Najombi nngolu waka Sapanga pajwijukua kitonga hesi mu maboku gaku nukukibeka palongi ja pandu pukupiiki matambiku jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />wiipwaga malobi ganga palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, ‘Atati bangu jabia mundu juku Ahalamu jojwabia jujendajenda koni nakoni, ndienu jwajenda ku Misili na jwatamahoku ngati nngeni. Jombi na alongu baki ngasebabii bingi pababia hoku, lakini babia bandu bunndema nkolongu na babia bingi na bana makili. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Amisili batenda kutubone nu kutung'alisa koni butuhengesa mahengu makolongu ngati atumwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Ndienu, tunndelila Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa Ahoku bitu, najombi jwajojwini kilelu situ na kugabona mang'aliku gitu na mahengu gaganonwipi na mang'aliku gatwabia tutenda kugapata. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga jutupia ku Misili kola sukutumii makili gaki makolongu na nginyuli na ndondukela. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Jutuleta pamba nukutupeke nndema gongo jejibii sapi kukupugi na kulema. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Ndienu nunndete Bambu Sapanga ilebi yu utumbuli yenhusiki mu migonda jagu mu munndema gojumbeki.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">“Ndienu wiibeka kitonga pai palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, nukulumbali palongi jaki. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Nawehapa wiitogulia majambo goti gaamboni gajugupeki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, wehapa na alongu baku. Nabombi biitogulia pamu na wehapa. <verse eid="DEU 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />Kila eipeta yaka itatu, kila mundu kati jiinu jwiipia pandu pamu pa komi pi ilebi yaki yoti kwa ndaba ja Alawi na ageni na akeba na akambomba baawii alomi babu ili apata posu joti jeapala paakuba mu misi jinu. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Ndienu wiipwaga palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu hana. ‘Nyumba jangu jipiiki lipungu la sapi nakwaapeke alawi na ageni na akeba na akambomba baawii alomi babu ngati hegunagalaki nhenga. Ngasengotwiki kuhenga malagalaki gaku wala ngasenyegwike. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Ngasenakuliki pandu pa komi pokapi panabia nakalobalakia, ngasenapagusiki panabia ngasenyetakiki palongi janku wala ngasenapia pandu pakomi pe hapa kwa ndaba ja mahoka. Nugujowani wa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wangu, nu kuhenga kila sindu segunagalaki. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Gulingalia pai kuhuma kunani kwa maundi kogutama sapi, gwapengila bandu baku Aizilaeli nu nndema goutupeki ngati hegwaalapi aseja bitu nndema gogunyambiki kupugi nu kulema.’<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa jaalakali bandu baka Bambu Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />“Lelenu Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, junndagalaki kukamu miilu na malagalaki ganga. Mmbia monndingalaki kuhenga kwa mwoju goha na loho joha. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Lelenu nzetaki kupwaga Bambu Sapanga kuba ndi Sapanga wino na mwiipwata indela yaki nukukamu mihilu yaki na malagalaki gaki nukunzoane jombi. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Najombi Bambu Sapanga lelenu junzetaki mwanganya kubanga mwabandu baki ngati hejunndagila kupwaga mpalika kukamu malagalaki ni miilu jaki joti. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Jwanhenga mwanganya kuba bandu akolongu ngani kupeta bandu bi milema jengi bajabombiki. Nanamu mwampekiya Bambu Sapanga ulumbi ni isima yaki. Mwanganya mwiibia mwabandu baka Sapanga ngati hejalagalaki.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Malagalaki gaka Sapanga gagaandikwi mu malibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Ndienu, Musa koni jubii pamu na akakilongosi buku Izilaeli jwaapwagila bandu ana, “Nkamula malagalaki goti ganumpeke lelenu. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Lisoba lemwiilombuka losi lwa Yoludani nukujingi mu nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jutei kumpeke mwiijemika malibu makolongu nu kukilima kwa chokaa. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Panani jaki mwihandika malobi goka ga malagalaki goti haga, pamwiijingila mu nndema golenganii kupugi nu kulema goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa aseja binu jwatei kunndagi. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Pamwiibia kwii ja losi Yoludani, mwiijemika malibu haga panani ji kitombi sa Ebali, ngati henunndagalakia lelenu nu kukilima kwa chokaa. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Mwansengila pandu pukupiki matambiku kwa malibu ganga kubasa kwa sindu sikisomasoma Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Pandu pukupiki matambiku pamwansengila Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu kupalika jisengwa kwa malibu ganga kubaswa. Panani ja pandu pukupiki matambiku mwampiikia Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino matambiku gukutinyi. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Mwampiikia matambiku gulukwali nakula papa nu kutogule palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Mwiiandika panani ja malibu haga malobi goha ga malagalaki ganga nukubonikana sapi.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Ndienu Musa pamu na agolu baka Sapanga Alawi baapwagila Aizilaeli boha, “Ntumbala nnyowania mwabandu buku Izilaeli. Lelenu mwanganya mmbi mwabandu baka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Henu mpalika kunzowane Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ana mpwatiki miilu jaki na malagalaki gaki ganunndagalaki lelenu.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaambamba yukusindwa kujoane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Lisoba heli Musa jwaalagalakia bandu nukupwaga, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />Emwibiya nndobwiki losi Yoludani, makabila ganga giijema panani jikitombi Gelizimu kwaapengee bandu buku Izilaeli, makabila ge ndi Simeoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakali na Yosefu na Benjamini. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Na makabila ganga giijema panani jikitombi Ebali ili kupwaga malobi ga yaambamba, Lubeni na Gadi na Asheli na Zebuluni na Dani na Nafutali. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Nabombi Alawi baalandila bandu boti buku Izilaeli kwa makili malobi ganga.<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“Jupata yaambamba mwanalomi jokapi jojulenganake imong'umong'u yukubasa au jukuyeyusha nukulumbali kwa sili sindu sekilenganakiwi kwa maboku gaka pundi najombi ndi sibia sindu sukusukisa kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino. Na bandu boa biijetakia, ‘Ena kubiya ahelahela!’<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“Jupata yaambamba mwanalomi jokapi jojampoa lihamu atati baki au amabu baki. Na bandu boa biitenda kujetake, ‘Ena kubiya ahelahela!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“Jupata yaambamba mwanalomi jokapi jojuboa alama jumpaka wa jwa pambipi jaki.” Na bandu boha biijetakia, Ena kubiya ahelahela!<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />Jupata yaambamba mundu jokapi joanhoa mundu jwanga kulinga kunhoa indela. Na bandu boha biijetakia, ena kubiya ahelahela!<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“Jupata yaambamba mundu jokapi kunzima sejupalika kupata nngeni au akeba au akambomba baawi alomi babu. Na bandu boha ajetakia, ‘Ena kubiya ahelahela!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“Jupata yaambamba mwanalomi jojugone nummbomba wa atati baki ndaba jaampoha lihamu atati baki. Na bandu boha biijetakia, ‘Ena kubiya ahelahela!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />Jupata yaambamba mundu jokapi jojwiigonila ni kinyama sokapi. Na bandu boha biijetakia, Ena kubiya ahelahela!<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />Jupata yaambamba mwanalomi jokapi jojwiigonila na dada waki jukubi mwana wa atati baki au wana wa amabaki. Na bandu boha bijetakia, Ena kubiya ahelahela.<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />Jupata yaambamba mundu jokapi jojugone na akoanu baki. Na bandu boha biijetakia, Ena kubiya ahelahela.<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />Jupata yaambamba mundu jokapi jojukoma kwa sili. Na bandu boha bajetakiya, Ena kubiya ahelahela.<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />Jupata yaambamba mundu jokapi jojujopa hongo ili junkoma mundu jwanga ni likosa. Na bandu bajetakiya, Ena kubiya ahelahela!<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />Jupata yaambamba mundu jokapi jwanga kukamu mlagalaki goti gaka Sapanga na mabole gaki. Na bandu boti bajetakiya, Ena kubiya ahelahela!<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Mbenge kwa babunzowane Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Alawi 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Kukomboka 7:12-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />Musa jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Ana anamunzoane Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu nukukamu mihilu jenunndagalaki lelenu, jombi jwanhenga mmbiya mwaakolongu kupeta bandu bi milema jengi joti punndema. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Ana munzoani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu mwiipata mbengee yenze.<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />“Misi jii na matui ginu giitenda kupengewa.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />“Bambu Sapanga jaampengila ili mpata ibeleku inge ni ilebi ingi na ng'ombi ingi na makondoo gingipe.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />“Ilebi inu na yombi inu yenhandali posu itenda kupengewa. <verse eid="DEU 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Bambu Sapanga mwiipengiliwa kwa kila sindu senhenga. <verse eid="DEU 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />Ana abaja bii biitenda kunndapu, Bambu Sapanga jwampekia uwesu wakwaawesa bombi. Ana ahikiki kunntukali kupete indela jimu baatilila kupete indela saba. <verse eid="DEU 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />Bambu Sapanga jampengaliya lihengu lii nu kutwelake mu ikoku yii yiilebi na mu mahengu gii goha. Jwampengila mu nndema gojumpeke.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />“Bambu Sapanga jwanhenga mmbiya mwabandu baki mweni ngati ejunndagalakiya, ana mugajetaki nu kukamu mihilu jaki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino nukupwata indela yaki. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Bandu bi milema joti punndema ana biibona mwanganya nkemwa ili mmbiya mwabandu baki mweni Bambu Sapanga giitenda kunzogopa. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Bambu Sapanga jwampekia bana bingi ni inyama hingi ni ilebi hingi mu matui mu nndema yejaalagila akakilongosi binu kubanga jwiitenda kumpeke, <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Bambu Sapanga jakunila mwanganya iyula kuhuma kunani kwa maundi kwaka Sapanga mu nndema kwa masoba gaki nu kumpenge mu mahengu gii. Mwaakopisa bandu bingi lakini mwanganya ngamwiikope. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wii jwanhenga mmbiya mwabandu bapanani na nga bandu bapai. Mwiiendalia kulongi na nga kukelabuka munnyuma ana nkamwi malagalaki gaki ganumpeke lelenu nu kugahenga. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Mwiikotoka kukamu mihilu jangu joti jenugupeki lelenu, sukujenda kumalele au kwa mangega kujipwata isapanga yengi nukujitumaki.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gagampata ananga kunnzoane Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Alawi 26:14-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />“Lakini ananga kunzetake Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu au ana ngankubi miu kuhenga malagalaki gaki goha ni miilu jaki jenunndagalaki lelenu, ndienu mwiipata yaambamba yoti yenze. <verse eid="DEU 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Bambu Sapanga jwanndigila mbamba pamwibiya ku misi jii na pamwibiya mu matui ginu. <verse eid="DEU 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Bambu Sapanga jwailigila mbamba ilebi inu na posu jinu. <verse eid="DEU 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Bambu Sapanga jiitenda kunndigi mbamba mpata bana asokopi ni mipugu yii yiipata yaambamba ili yiijonzukeka. <verse eid="DEU 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Mwiipata yaambamba kila sindu senhenga.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />“Ana nhengiki majambu giliya nukukana Bambu Sapanga jwanndetila mang'aliku mwiitenda kusanganyikiwa mwisindwa kuhenga mahengu ginu. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Jandetila magonzu mabaja mbaka pamwikuwa mwaboti mu nndema gonzenda kugukamu. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Bambu Sapanga jwaguletila magonzu makolongu na maputi na lyotu likali nu ujomu na mang'aliku nu likongobu ndi mwiipata ubini hogu mbaka kuwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Iyula ngajiikuni nu nndema wiibiya ngati kisomasoma. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Badala ji iyula Bambu Sapanga jwiileta kibonga su nsangi nu luombi, yankunila mbaka nkuwa.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />“Bambu Sapanga jaguhenga bugulapula abaja baku. Mwiipitila kwi indela jimu, lakini mwiitila kwi indela saba. Nanamu mwiibiya sindu sukusukisa kwa bandu wote bupundema. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Pamwikuwa mituhi jinu ndi jibiya posu ji ijuni yukunani ni inyama yupundema wala ngajwiikubi mundu jukuibenga. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Bambu Sapanga jaandapula sukunhenga mmbiya na maputi ngati ejahenga kwa bandu buku Misili, jwaguhenga gubiya ni ilonda nu maputi gaganyanya gaguge ngamwiiwesi kulama. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Bambu Sapanga jwaanhenga mmbiya na mangongu na kabee janhenga mmbiya mwanga kulinga na mwanga kumanya seanhenga. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Muhi mwiijenda sukupapa papaa ngati mundu jojusindwa kulinga wala ngamwiiwezi kuhenga mahengu ginu. Kila kipindi bandu banzopa hindu yinu na ngakwiikubi na mundu jukunzangatila.<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />“Mwaasumba akakamwali lakini akanalomi bangi biigonila naku. Anansengiki nyumba bandu bangi biitama homu. Ana mpandiki mizabibu bandu bangi ndi babihusa. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Ng'ombi yinu baisinza palongi ja mihu ginu lakini ngamwiihonzi hata kipandi simu si inyama. Maponda ginu bagajukuwa kwa makili palongi ja mihu ginu wala ngabankelubukile. Makondoo ginu baapekia akabaja binu, na ngajikubi mundu jukuwesa kunzangatila. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Bana binu akanalomi na akambomba baapiya kwa bandu bangi kuba atumwa koni ndingali kila lisoba mwiitupa mihu kulingali ana atenda kukelabuka, lakini ngamwiikubi na makili gukuhenga sokapi. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Bandu bi milema jengi biihika kujuku ilebi yinu yoti yu munndema winu na matunda ginu nanamu banzopa hindu yinu nu kung'aliswa kipindi soti. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Mwiikuba na mangongu kwa ndaba ja majambu haga gamwagabona kwa mihu ginu mwabeti. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Bambu Sapanga jagalapula magoti ginu na magolu ginu kwa maputi gagabi nu ubini nkali gaguge ngagiwesi kulamika, gijagania kutumbuli mu yaju yu magolu ginu mbaka pulutoto.”<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />“Bambu Sapanga jampelika mwanganya na bambu nkolongu winu jomwalisagulia, mbaka ku nndema wa bandu babube mwanganya ngase mwaamanyike wala akahoku binu. Hoku mwaitumakia isapanga yengi yi mikongu na malibu. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Mwiibiya mwabandu banga kupalika na bandu, na mwiibiya mwempowa lihamu na mwiibiya sindu sukusangasa pikilanda ja bandu boti bunndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga jitenda kumpeleka. <verse eid="DEU 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Mwanganya mwiipanda imbeju lakini mwiihusa kidogu pena kwa ndaba halwa ikula ilebi yinu. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Mwiipanda mizabibu nukujitunza, lakini ngamwiitongo mizabibu heji wala kunywa divai jaki, kwa ndaba hindu yiitenda kula. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Mwiikuba ni mizeituni pandu poti pu nndema winu, lakini ngamwiikubi na mahuta gukupakii, kwa ndaba zeituni heyi yitenda kupolota. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Mwiipapa bana akanalomi na bana akambomba, lakini ngabiikubi bino, biijukuliwa nukujenda pandu pangi ngati atumwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Matunda ginu goti ni ilebi yinu yoti mu migonda jinu giikula na halwa.<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />“Ageni baatama mu nndema winu biihendalia kupata makili koni mwanganya nhendalee kukosa makili. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Bombi ndi bankopisa mwanganya, lakini mwanganya ngamwiikubi nu uwesu ukwakopesa. Bombi biibiya kimutu na mwanganya mwiibiya nkela.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />“Haga goti gampata mwanganya mbaka pabankoma kwa ndaba ngase mwijijetaki sauti jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu kupete kugakamu malagalaki gaki ni mihilu jaki jejumpekia. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Haga gibiya galangi Bambu Sapanga juyomi ngamaa mwanganya ni ibeleku hinu nanamu mwagamanya haga masoba gi goa.<verse eid="DEU 28:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />“Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jumpengi mu kila sindu, lakini mwanganya ngasemutumaki kwa mwoju wii woti sukutogule. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Ndienu mwaatumakiya akabaja binu babube Bambu Sapanga jwaaleta kwinu. Mwiibiya ni inzala na nywita na mwiibiya heu nu kujomukane kila sindu. Akabaja binu baahenga nhenga mahengu makolongu mbaka pamwiikuwa.”<verse eid="DEU 28:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />“Bambu Sapanga jaaleta bandu banga Ayaudi kuhuma kutali ili luntukalia kanyata ngati kijuni sebikikema tai, bandu behaba ngasemwijimanyi luga jabu. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Bandu behaba pamiu jabu pibiya pabepiki ngamaa na ngabaabonee ikia akaseja wala akakombu, <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />biikula mipugu jinu ni ilebi yii mbaka pabankoma. Ngabandeke ilebi wala divai wala mahuta wala ng'ombi au likondoo na mwiing'alika ni inzala mbaka kuwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Bandu haba biilapula kila musi mu nndema winu ni mimatu jii milasu jemujihobale jiitenda kubomboka. Kila pandu mu nndema winu goguwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jatenda kumpekea. <verse eid="DEU 28:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Kipindi abaja binu pabibiya ayongalwiti mu misi jinu mwibiya ni inzala ngani mbaka mwaakula bana binu, bana babube Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jumpekia. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Hata mundu jwanga na puju jokapi joankoiki sapi janzima posu nndongu waki, nhwanu waki joampala ngani na mwanamundu jojuhigali, <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />wala ngajambaguli hata jumwa wabu inyama ja bana baki bajwaakula. Ngamwiihigali na sindu sokapi sela kipindi sukuyongolotwa hesi sukumpengalela nu kupata mang'aliku kuhuma kwaka abaja binu mu misi jinu joti. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Hata mmbomba jojubii ni isima ngani joankoiki samboni na jojunyambiki jojuwe lwaju lwaki ngaseluwaiki kukanyati luhombi, najombi jwiihenga ahelahe. Kipindi hesi sukuyongolota siibiya ni inzala ngani, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />hata jwankula mwana waki nkeki ni lipyanda sanga hata nndomi waki kumanya wala jumu kati ja bana baki kumanya.”<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />“Ana ngasenhangali kuhenga malobi goti gi mihilu jenze jejiandikwi mu kitabu senze na ngase muhengi isima nu kulilumbali lihina lelijogopesa laka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />hela ndi Bambu Sapanga jwandetila mwanganya ni ibeleku yinu mang'aliku ganga kuyobaleka, mang'aliku makali ganga kuwesa kulama. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Jwanndetila kabee magonzu gamugajogupa emwabii kundema uku Misili, nagombi gankelabukia kambelikambeli. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Jwandetila magonzu ga kila namuna na mang'aliku gangi gaguge ngasejugalogwi mu kitabu senze su mihilu na mwiitenda kuwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Mwanganya mwembii mwa bingi ngati ndondu yukunani mwiihigalia mwaasikipi pena, ndaba ngasempai kunzetake Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Ngati Bambu Sapanga ekundengani majambu ginu gunzendila sapi mwanganya mbiyaa mwabingi, ahelahe Bambu Sapanga ejupala kundete mabaja nukunkoma. Nanamu jwammboa mu nndema hogu goguwe nzenda kutama. <verse eid="DEU 28:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />Bambu Sapanga jwampesangana mu milema ja bandu bangi joti, kuhumi upandi gumwa gu nndema mbaka upandi gongi na hoku mwaitumakia isapanga yengi yi mikongu na malibu yeyuye mwanganya wala akahoku binu ngaseawaiki kuimanya. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Mu milema heji ngamwiwesi kutogule wala ngamwiikubi na pandu pakupakema panyumba ila Bambu Sapanga janhenga nhola hola mu mioju jinu, na mihu ginu gitenda kususuka na mwiikuba nu kuhangajika mmwoju.”<verse eid="DEU 28:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />“Mwiitama sukujogopa muwi ni ikilu mwiibiya mwabandu bukujogopa na ngamwiikubi na womi. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />K wa ndaba jukuhola kokwitwelala mmwoju winu na hindu yela yeyuye miu gaku gatei kwiibona. Pulukela mwiipwaga, ‘Mbanga kukabii pakamii,’ pakamii pakwihika mwiipwaga, ‘Mbanga kukabii pulukela,’ <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Bambu Sapanga jwankelubua mu nndema uku Misili kwa meli, konunndagila kubanga ngamwikelabuki hoku kabee. Hoku mwiilenga kulilombesa kwa abaja binu ili mbiya mwaatumwa, lakini ngamundu joandombaje.”<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga mu nndema uku Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Haga ndi malobi gi lilaganu lelule Bambu Sapanga anndagalakiya Musa juhenga na Aizilaeli mu nndema uku Moabu, kulekana ni lilaganu Bambu Sapanga lejahenga nabu ku kitombi sa Helobu. <verse eid="DEU 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Musa jaakema Aizilaeli boti jaapwagila, “Mwabweni mwabeti namuna Bambu Sapanga eanhengila bambu nkolongu Falau juku Misili, na akakilongosi na atumisi baki nu nndema woti. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Mwagabweni mwabeti majambu gajahengiki Bambu Sapanga gaguge ndi mang'aliku makolongu, nginyuli na majambu gukusangasa. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Lakini mbaka lelenu Bambu Sapanga ngasejaapeki malangu gukumanya, gamwapeti gala miu gukulinga wala makutu gukujoa!<verse eid="DEU 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />“Kwa yaka alubaini, nepani naalongusa kulukoba, ingobu inu yemwawati ngaseyalaile wala ilatu inu ngaseyalaile mu magolu ginu. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Ngasemwabii na mabumunda wala kunywa divai au sindu sukulobe, lakini Bambu Sapanga jajangatiya kwaapeke goti haga ili mmanya kubanga Bambu Sapanga ndi Sapanga winu.<verse eid="DEU 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />“Pamwahika pandu hapa, bambu nkolongu Sihoni juku Heshiboni na bambu nkolongu juku Bashani bahika kukomana na twepani, lakini twatenda kwaawesa, <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />twajukua nndema wabu, twaagabagila makabila gaka Lubeni na Gadi na nusu ji likabila laka Manase gubiya gwabu. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Ndienu nhangaliya nu kukamu malobi goti gi lilaganu hale ili majambu gi gajenda sapi mu mahengu ginu goti.<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />“Lelenu nnzemiki palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, mwanganya mwaboti na akakilongosi ba makabila, aseja binu, akaapisa binu, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />ahanu binu na bana binu na ageni baatama mu makambi ginu babube aseku hanzu na kwaateke masi. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Mmbii pamba lelenu ili kuhenga lilaganu lende lelule Bambu Sapanga winu juhenga lelenu, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />kubanga jaalangia lelenu kuba ndi bandu baki najombi jibiya Sapanga winu, ngati ejaalapila mwanganya na akahoku binu, Abulamu ni Isaka na Yakobu. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Wala ngasehenga lilaganu hale na mwanganya kajika pena nu kulogo yaambamba yaki. <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />Ila kabee kwa ndaba ja bandu banga kuba pamu ni ibelaku itu yeyuye ngaseisaliwi. Ngahengi kwa ndaba ja bala pena baabii pamu na twepani lelenu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />“Mmanyiki namuna etwabiya tutama ku Misili na namuna etwabiya tujenda mu nndema wa bandu bangi mbaka patuhikiki pamba. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Mwiibweni imong'umong'u yabu yeisukisa yebabiya atenda kuilumbali hei ndi isapanga imikongu na malibu ga madini ga feza na zahabu. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Nndingaliya kupwaaga nga mwanalomi wala mmbomba, lukolu au likabila lokapi lelijema pamba lelenu lelandeka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, kujenda kutumaki isapanga ya bandu bi milema jengi. Lijambu heli libiya ngati mikega jejimela nu kupapa matunda gagababa na gagabii na sumu. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Ngati baada jukujoa malobi gi lilaganu hale lelule ntei kuliga ndienu mundu anajilipwagi mweni mmwoju jaki nibiya sapi hata ngati ngasengamu mihilu je heji, heli laankoma mwaboti mwaabaja na baamboni. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Bambu Sapanga ngabanndekake mundu hoju, nayombi inyela yaka Bambu Sapanga na wipu waki yanyakila mundu hoju, yaambamba yoti yeiandikwi mu kitabu senze yanhikila, najombi Bambu Sapanga jaliputa liina laka mundu hoju kuhuma pu nndema. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />Bambu Sapanga ambeka kutali kati ja makabila goti guku Izilaeli ili jupata mang'aliku kulengana na yaambamba yoti i lilaganu leliandikwi mu kitabu senze sa malagalaki. <verse eid="DEU 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Mu ibeleku yeihika, ibeleku inu kuhuma kunndema uku kutali biibona namuna Bambu Sapanga ejuguletila nndema gongo mang'aliku na kuwa. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Nndema waku wibiya guhalabiki sukutwele malibu gikibiliti na mwinyu ngasindu sokapi sesimela wala manyoi ngagimeli. Ndema winu wibiya ngati Sodoma na Gomola au Adima na Seboimu jejijihalabana Bambu Sapanga pajaakoma kwi inyela yaki ingali . <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Hena, bandu bangi bi milema jengi biipwaaga, ‘Ndaba jakii Bambu Sapanga juguhengii nndema hogo? Inyela hei ngolongu jiilangi kike?’ <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Ndi biipwaga, ‘Ndi ndaba batunula lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa aseja babu jahenga nabu pajapia mu ndema juku Misili, <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />bajenda kujitumakii nu kuilumbali isapanga yengi, yeyuye ngasebamanyiki pu utumbuli, jejuje Bambu Sapanga jaakana bajilumbali. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Ndienu inyela yaka Bambu Sapanga yanyaka kupete bandu bu nndema gongo, nu kujilete mang'aliku kulengana na yaambamba yeiandikwi mu kitabu senze. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Hesi ndi sesunhenga Bambu Sapanga, jaaboa kuhuma mu nndema wabu jaayomi ngamaa na jaapelika mu milema ji kigeni na abii hoku mbaka lelenu.’<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />“Majambu gagajobiki ndi gaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, lakini gabagayekwi ndi gitu ni ibeleku itu yaka yoti, ili tuhenga malobi goti ga malagalaki ganga.”<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Bambu Sapanga jaapenge bandu baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Musa jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Numpeki nhagula kati ja mbengale na yaambamba. Majambu haga goti anagumpatiki nanamu anamugaholali pokapi pammbii kati ja bandu bu nndema gongi momuje Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jibiya jumpesangini, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />ana munkelabukiya Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, mwanganya na bana binu, nu kujetake kwa mwoju winu woti na loho joti lilobi laki lenundagalaki lelenu, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />hapa ndi Bambu Sapanga winu, jankelabukia gaamboni ginu na kwaabone ikia lelenu na kwaakusanya kabee kuhuma mu milema jengi jejuje jibiya japesangini. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Hata ananibiya naapesangini mu nndema ukutali ngani, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jaankusanya na kwaakelabuki, <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />ili gubiya winu kabee nndema gobabia atama aseja binu. Najombi jaanhenga majambu gi gajenda sapi ngani nakuba mwabingi kupeta aseja binu. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jaahengila mwanganya ni ibeleku inu mmbiya na mwoju ukujetake ili mumpala jombi kwa mwoju winu woti na loho jinu joti, ili nhwesa kutama. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jaiboa yaambamba heyi kwinu na yaapata abaja binu babunng'alisa. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Nanamu mwannzoaninya Bambu Sapanga nu kujikamu mihilu jaki joti jenumpeki lelenu. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jaahenga mpengiliwa mu kila lemwiihenga, mwiibiya na bana bingi na ng'ombi hingi na matui gingi giipia ilebi. Ndaba jiipala kabee ndaba janhenga majambu gi gajenda sapi ngati ejapala kwaapenge aseja binu, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />ana munnzoani jombi nukukamu mihilu na malagalaki gaki gagahandikwi mu kitabu senze sa malagalaki nukunkelabukii Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, kwa mwoju winu woti na loho jinu joti.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />“Miilu jenumpeke lelenu ngasejinonwipi kwinu, nu nhwesa kuihenga. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Ngaseibii kunani kwa maundi kwaka Sapanga mbaka mpwaga, ‘Nya jojwilombuka nhanga jutuletila ili tuijoaninya nu kuijetake.’ <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Wala ngaseibii kwii ju nhanga nkolongu, hata mpwagi, ‘Nya jojwiilombuka nhanga nkolongu jutuletila ili tujoaninya nukujetake.’ <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Ngahela, ila ibii pambipi na mwanganya, mundomu jinu nu mumioju jinu, nhwesa kujihenga.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />“Lelenu numpeke nhagula kati ja gaamboni na giliya, kati ja womi na kuwa. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Ana nzetaki miilu jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jenumpeke lelenu, kumpala Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, nu kupwata indela yaki nukukamu mihilu yaki, nukukamu malagalaki gaki, ndienu mwiitama nukujonzukeka, najombi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jaampengaliya munndema gounzenda kulongosa. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Lakini mioju jii jing'anambuki kutali nu kukana kunzoane, nu kutokule kwiilumbali imong'umong'u yengi nukuitumaki, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />nepani nuntangasii lelenu kupwaaga mwiitenda kuwa. Ngamwiitami kwa masoba gingi mu nndema gounzenda kutama, gogubii kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Nugukema nndema nu kunani kwa maundi ilingaliya kupete mwanganya lelenu, kubanga numpeke kuhagu kati ja womi na kuwa, kati ja mbengale na yaambamba. Ndienu nhagula womi ni ibeleku inu iwesa kutama, <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />anamumpai Bambu Sapanga winu, anamunzowani jwombi nukujongana naku. Ndaba kuhenga hela kulangi mwiiwesa kutama masoba gingi nukutama mu nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga gojaalagila aseja binu, Abulahamu ni Isaka na Yakobu, kubanga jiitenda kumpeke.”<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s">Joshua jujuku napwasi jaka Musa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 27:12-23">Esabu 27:12-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Ndienu Musa jaendaliya kulonge na Aizilaeli boti, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />jaapwagila, “Nepani henu ndi mina yaka mia jimu ni ishilini na ngasemii kabee na makili gukuhenga mahengu nakanopi. Kabee Bambu Sapanga jumbwagi kubanga nganomboki losi lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jaalonguliya na kwaakoma bandu bu nndema gongi baatama hoku, ili nndema hogu gwiibiya jinu. Joshua jiibiya kilongosi winu ngati ejapwaaga Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Bambu Sapanga jiitenda kwaakoma bandu baatama mu nndema hogu ngati ejaakoma Sihoni na Ogu, bambu nkolongu jwa Aamoli, nu nndema wabu. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Bambu Sapanga jaanhenga mwaawesa bombi, nanamu mwaahengila ngati enunndagalakiya. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Mmbiya nganganganga na mwoju ukuwesa wala mwaajogopa haba ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ndi jojujenda pamu na nanamu. Jombi ngajiikotoki kwaajangati na ngajaaleke.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Ndipala Musa ankema Joshua, palongi ja bandu boti buku Izilaeli ampwagila, “Gubiya nganganganga na mwoju ukuwesa, ndaba wehapa waalongusa bandu haba kujenda kugujuku nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga jaalagila akahoku babu, na wehapa wakabisa gubia gwabu. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Bambu Sapanga ndi jojaalongosa, jombi jibiya pamu nanamu, jombi ngajikotoki kunzangatii na ngajaandeki. Ndienu mwiijogopa wala mwiihangajika mioju jii.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusoma malagalaki kila saka sa saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Ndienu, Musa jaandika malagalaki haga, jaapekiya agolu bu lukolu lwa Lawi babube babiya na mahengu gukutoto Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga, kabee jaapekia aseja boti buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Ndienu jaalagalakiya, “Kila mwisu wa saka sa saba siibiya saka sakwalekake bandu. Mwiisoma malagalaki haga kwa sauti, kipindi sa matola gi indamba, <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />kipindi bandu buku Izilaeli paahika kunndumbali Bambu Sapanga pandu pajupasagwili mwaasomila bandu boti buku Izilaeli malagalaki ganga. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Waakusanya bandu, akanalomi na akammbomba bana na ageni baatama mumisi jinu, ili kila jumu jujoa malagalaki haga gukulibola kunntende isima Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, na kuba baangali kugahenga malagalaki ganga. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Nabombi ibeleku yabu yeyuye ngaseagamanyiki malagalaki gaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, awesa kugajoane nu kulibola kunzoane Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, kipindi soti momwiitama mu nndema goguwe gonzenda kutama kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagalaki gamwisu gaka Bambu Sapanga kwaka Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Musa, “Lisoba laku lukulitabuka nndema guhegalii. Nkema Joshua, nhika pamu mu Lihema lukuketangane ili numpekiya malagalaki.” Ndienu Musa na Joshua bajenda mu lihema lukuketangane, <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />najombi Bambu Sapanga japitila homu mu nguzu ja mahundi jejuje jajema munndyangu ulihema heli.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Musa, “Guhegalii henu kujomoka, na hegwiibia gujomwiki, bandu biitumbuliya kuneka nu kuijende isapanga yu mu nndema hogu goguwe biijenda kutama, biineka nu kutunu lilaganu lenagani nabu. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Lisoba heli nanhyomila ngamaa nukunndeka, nukuhiya pamihu jangu pambipi naku, biitenda kukomeka. Majambu gingi na mang'aliku giitenda kumpata mbaka biimanya mahakau gala gaapatiki ndaba Sapanga wabu ngasejubii kati jabu. <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Sakaka nepani nga nanzangati ndaba ahengiki majambu gilia nu kung'anambuki isapanga yengi.<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Henu andika nhwambu gongo, waabola bandu buku Izilaeli ili malobi gaki galangia abii na makosa ndaba ngasebanyetaki nepani. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Paapelika mu nndema gongo mu nndema gogulengana kupugi nu kulema, ngati enaalagila akahoku banu, nabombi biikula nu kutupi, biing'anambukia isapanga yengi nukuitumaki, biitenda kunoong'ama nu kutunu lilaganu langu. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Pabiipata mang'aliku gingi na majambu gingi giliya, nhwambu gongo waakumbukia abii na makosa ndaba ngabagujewi bombi ni ibeleku yabu. Sajenu, kabula ngasenaapeliki mu nndema gonumpeki, nijimanyika mipangu jeapangiki.”<verse eid="DEU 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Ndienu, Musa jaandika nhwambu lisoba lelele, na kwaabola Aizilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga anndagalakiya Joshua, mwana waka Nuni, ampwagila, “Gubia nganganganga na mwoju ukuwesa, ndaba walongua Aizilaeli mu nndema goguwe naalapi kwaapeke, nanepani niibiya pamu nawe.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Musa pajajomula kuandika malobi ga malagalaki haga tumbuka puutumbuli mbaka mwisu, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />jaapwagila Alawi, bababii ni lihengu lukutoto Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Nnzukua kitabu sa malagalaki hase, mmbeka pambipi ni lisanduku li lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ili Aizilaeli awesa kumanya paakose. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Ndaba manyiki emmbii mwabandu mong'anambuka na biniing'omu. Ana mmbii moung'anambuka Bambu Sapanga kipindi enabii namwomi pamu na mwanganya, kwibiya boo baada ya kuwa kwangu? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Akusanya palongi jangu akakilongosi boti ba makabila ginu na akolongu bii mbata kupwaaga malobi haga ajoaninya, nakwombi kunani kumaundi nu nndema ijowaa paniibia naapwagi bandu abaa. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Ndaba manyiki kubanga baada ja kuwa kwangu sakaka mwiibiya mwaabaja nu kujileka indela jenuundagila mwijipwata. Na mu masoba gagahika gaampata mang'aliku na majambu giliya kubanga mwiihenga kihakau palongu jaka Bambu nu jombi kuyome kwa mahengu ginu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwambu waka Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Ndienu, Musa jaajembila nhwambu gongo palongi ju nkutanu gwoti gwa Aizilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />“Mwaa bandu mommbi mundema ni iumbi yeibii kunani, nnzoaniya malobi gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">Joaninya mwaa bandu bupunndema, malobi gaambwaga.”<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Mabolee gangu ga tonya ngati iyula ngati iyula jejikuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">malobi gangu gaajangatia bandu baajowane ngati ulumi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">ngati kameme kiiyula ekajangati mimea misoku kukola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">ngati iyula nzoku mu manyoi mabei.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Ndaba niitangasa liina laka Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">kila mundu jupalika jumanya, Sapanga witu ndi nkolongu.<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />“Bambu Sapanga ndi lilibu la womi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">mahengu gaki ndi gajaganii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">najombi juhenga pe gagapalia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Tuwesa kunhobale na twepani bandu kutuhobale</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Jombi juhenga majambu ga uamboni na ga haki.”<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Lakini mwanganya nkosiki kuhobaleka kwaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mwanganya nga mwabana baki kabee ndaba ju uhakau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mwanganya ndi kibeleku si kihakau nu kibaja.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Nnhwesa boo kunndepa hela Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">mwabandu mwaang'ang'a na mwanga na malango?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Boo, mwanganya ngalee atati binu jojummbombiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">jojunhenga nukunhenga mmbia na makili?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Nkombuka masoba gagapetiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">nhwasaliya yaka yiibeleku hingi yeipetiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">Mwaalalukiya atati binu nabombi bitenda kumanyasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">mwaalalukiya akolongu binu nabombi biitenda kwaalandi.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Sapanga nkolongu pajijibagila milema na mali gabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">pajaabaga bandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">kila milema jijipekiya mipaka jaki,<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Lakini Sapanga jaagula abia bana baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">bana baka Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">Lakini jaagula bana baka Yakobu kuba baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">haba bilihaguliya kuba mali gaki.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />Jaaketaninya mu nndema uku lukoba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">lukoba lutopu lolubii nu nhwai nkolongu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">Jaalenda na kwaatunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">jaahenga ngati liu laki. <verse eid="DEU 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Ngati tai jojulenda nhui waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">nu kuhombahomba panani ja mabwela gaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">anajutandisi mapapati gaki ili kwaakamulaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">na kwaatoto panani ja mapapati gaki.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Jombi Bambu Sapanga mweni jaalongosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">na ngasejapaliki kuba ni kisapanga sengi sukujangati.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Jaapetisa mu ukanda ukunani ju nndema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">nabombi bakula ilebi yabu ku matui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">Jaapekiya busi mu malibu aonza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">na mahuta kuhuma mu mizeituni jejimei muluombi lolubii mu malibu.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />“Jaapekiya masiba gagagandiki ga ng'ombi na masiba gi mipugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">mahuta gi likondoo ni likondoo lipongu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">makundi gi mipugu juku Bashani ni imbui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">Jaapekiya inganu ya sapi na divai inyai batenda kunywa.”<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Bandu buku Izilaeli banenipi ngamaa nu kupega mateki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">banenipi, babii ni kitambi nu kunyambabali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">ndienu bunndeka Sapanga jojabomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">bundongama nkolongu ju uokovu wabu. <verse eid="DEU 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Bambu jwabona wipu nkolongu kwi isapanga yabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">bunhenga juyomaa kwa mahengu gabu gukusukisa.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Bagapikiya matambiku majobi gaguge ngasegabiya isapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">biijendila isapanga, yeyuye ngasebiimanyiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">isapanga inyai yeyapitika masoba ga pambipi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">yeyuye aseja babu ngasebiitendi isima hata pasokopi.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Bunzewiki Sapanga jojubii mwomi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">Munzewiki Sapanga jojummbelika mwanganya.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />Bambu Sapanga jilibweni lijambu leheli jatenda kwaaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">jaakana bana baki, akanalomi na akammbomba.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Jaapwaaga, Nga naajangati kabee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">nagubona mwisu wabu wibiya bole!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Ndaba bombi ndi kibeleku siliya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Bana banga kuhobaleka kwokapi.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Anhengiki mia na wipu kwa bombi kutumaki isapanga yiisoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">anhyomisi kwi imong'umong'u yabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Ndienu naahenga abona wipu kwakwaajangatia bandu babube bombi baabona ang'ang'a,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">naahenga ayoma sakwaatumi bandu bunndema wa ang'ang'a.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Inyela yangu inyakiki mwotu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">jijosa mbaka pai ku libomba langa na mwisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">jitinia nndema na yoti yeibii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">jitinia misingi ji itombi.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />Nilundika mang'aliku kila pandu kupete bombi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">Niijomuliya mikoa jangu.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Biikombala kwi inzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">biikuwa kwa homa ingali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">Niipelika inyama yeibii na minu makali kaaluma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">na majoka gagabii na sumu ingali gagakwaba mu luombi.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Ngondu jiileta kuwa kwingipi kunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">na mumanyumba bibiya atenda kuhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">akakombu akanalomi na akammbomba biitenda kuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">hata baajonga na aseja baabii na uliya.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Naapwaaga, nukunkoma tipitipi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">na kwaahenga biikombokwa kabee na mundu jokapi,<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />ila pe kwa ndaba jukukipuna kwa abaja binu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">Ili abaja binu bihika kuholale na gangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">biihika kupwaaga, awesiki kwaakoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">nanepani Bambu Sapanga ndi nenanhenga majambu gehaga!<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Izilaeli ndi nndema wanga na malangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">bandu baki ngaseabii ni isima nkati jabu.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Bakawesa kuba ni isima bakamanya ndaba jaki batenda kusindwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">Bakawesa kuelewa mwisu wabu wibiya bole. <verse eid="DEU 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Mundu jumu juwesa boo kwaawesa bandu elupu jimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">au bandu abeli awesa boo kwaawesa bandu elupu komi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">kuwesikana pee ngati Sapanga wabu jutei kwaaleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Bambu Sapanga wabu jutei kwaaleka?<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Hata abaja bitu beni ajetaki pe sapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">isapanga yabu nga na makili ngati ejubii Sapanga juku Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Ndaba mizabibu yabu ndi mizabibu juku Gomola, ihumii mu litui luku Gomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">Zabibu yaki ndi zabibu yeibii na sumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">ingonyu yaki ndi yeibaba,<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Divai yabu ndi ngati sumu ji lijoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:33">jibii na sumu ingali ja majoka.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />“Boo Bambu Sapanga ngasejujewa gabuhengi abaja baku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">Julendale kipind sa sapi sakwaalapu.”<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Kulepa kisasi ndi lihengu langu nepani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">nepani niilepisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">kipindi pabihabuka, ndaba lisoba la mang'aliku lihiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">mwisu wabu gubii pambipi ngani.<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Bambu Sapanga jaakengaliya bandu baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">na kwaabone ikia atumisi baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">kipindi pajiibona ngasejubii na bandu bakwaajangati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">wala nga mundu jojuhigaliya, mpugwa au mundu hulu.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga pajaalalukiya bandu baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">Ibii kwaa isapanga ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">isapanga yemwiitililaje koni nholale kupata womi?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Ibii kwaa isapanga yeikula matambiku ginu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">na kunywa divai na matambiku ginu ga kunywa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Nala ijumuka yunzangatiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">mwiileka enu iibiya kinga jinu henu!<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />Linga kuba nepani ndi Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">na wala nga jongi ila nepani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Nepani ndenda kukoma nukubeka womi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Kuumisa nu kulamisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">na ngakuba jojuwesa kunhokoa jokapi mu maboku gangu.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Nyosa kuboku kwangu kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">nu kulapa kwa womi wangu wa yaka yanga na mwisu.<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />Ana mugubweni upanga wangu gogung'anyiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">nu kutondabe kuboku ili kutemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">naalepa kisasi abaja bangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na kwaalapu baanzuki.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />“Naankoma mwa abaja bangu boti banaakamwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">upanga wangu wiikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">waakoma bandu babuhumisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">abaja bangu abii bana majunzu malasu.”<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />“Mwaabandu bi milema jengi nnzongana pamu na bandu baki kunndumbali Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">ndaba jombi jwiilepisa kisasi kwa boti babaakomiki atumisi baki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">Kwaalepe kisasi abaja baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">nu kugulekake bandu bu nndema waki.”<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Musa na Aloni, mwana waka Nuni bahika palongi jaka Yoshua, bakombuka malobi gu nhwambu gongo, ili Aizilaeli boti ajoaninya.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malobi ga mwisu gaka Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Musa pajajomula kwaapwagi bandu buku Izilaeli malobi haga goti, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />jaapwagila, “Mwagabeka mmioju jinu nukugajetake malobi goti ganumpeke lelenu. Kupalika kwaalagalaki bana binu ili mwaapwata sukuhobaleka malobi goti ga malagalaki ganga. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Ndaba malagalaki ganga nga malobi matopu kwinu ila ndi womi winu, kwa malagalaki ganga mwiitama maisa malasu mu nndema gonnzenda kutama, kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Lisoba alelale, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Musa, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Kwela kitombi ase saka Abalimu mbaka ku kitombi sa Nebu sekibii mu nndema uku Moabu, pambipi na musi uku Yeliku, ana ujilingali nndema uku Kanani jenaapeki Aizilaeli atama. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Ndienu wiikuwa nukutagwa mu kitombi sehesi ngati mmbeli waku Aloni ejakuwa nu kutagwa mu kitombi suku Holi, <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />ndaba mwaboti mwabeli mwatunula kuhobaleka kwinu palongi ja Aizilaeli pamwabii mu masi ku Meliba, pambipi na musi uku Kadeshi, mu lukoba luku Sini, na ndaba mwasidwa kuhenge isima palongi ja bandu buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Wagubona nndema gogubii palongi jaku lakini ngawijingii mu nndema hogu gonaapeki Aizilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Musa jagapenge makabila guku Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Yenze ndi mbenge yeyuye Musa, mundu waka Sapanga jaapwagila Aizilaeli kabula ja kuwa kwaki, Japwaaga, <verse eid="DEU 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Bambu Sapanga jahika kuhuma ku kitombi Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">jutupitila ku kitombi suku Seili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">janang'ana ngati liyoba kuhuma kitombi sa Palani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Japitila kati ja atumi bingi bukunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">na mwotu gogunyaka mu kuboku kwaki uku malele.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Bambu Sapanga jaapala bandu baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">na kwaalonda bandu baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">Ndienu, atumi baki batama pambipi najombi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">nu kupwata malagalaki kuhuma kwaki.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Musa jutulagalakiya tujetakiya miilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">hesi ndi sindu saamboni ngani sukutujangati mu nndema witu.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Ndienu, jabiya bambu nkolongu juku Yelushuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">kipindi akakilongosi ba bandu pabaketangana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">na makabila goti guku Izilaeli pagaketangana.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Kwa makabila gaka Lubeni jaapwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">“Lubeni jutama wala jiikuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">na bandu baki biikuba asoku.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Kwa likabila luku Yuda japwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">“Mwaa Bambu Sapanga gujoanakiya kilelu si likabila laka Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">gulihenga kujongana na bandu baki kabee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Gukomana kwa maboku gaku kwa ndaba jaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">gulijangatiya likabila laka Yuda kupete abaja baki.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Kwa likabila laka Lawi, japwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">“Mwaa Bambu Sapanga gwaapekiya Alawi lilobi laku lu Ulimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">lilobi laku la sumimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">babube waalenga ku Masa nukukomana naku mu masi guku Meliba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Alawi biileka nyumba yabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">ili awesa kukutumaki sapi wehapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">alijoanii lilobi laku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">babiya baahobaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">nukukamulaki miilu jaku.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Ni likabila la Alawi baabola ibeleku yaka Yakobu malagalaki gaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">baabola bandu buku Izilaeli miilu jaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">Alawi na apogaliya ubani palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">matambiku goa gukutinia pandu pukupiki matambiku, <verse eid="DEU 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Mwaa Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">wagapengaliya makili gabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">wagajetakiya mahengu ga maboku gaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">tunula makili ga abaja babu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">makili ga bandu babugusuki biijumuka kabee.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Ku likabila laka Benjamini jaapwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">“Heli ndi likabila lejulipai Bambu Sapanga nukulilenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">jwaalenda muhi pipipi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">nu kutama pikilanda jabu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Ku likabila laka Josepu jaapwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">“Bambu Sapanga nu jugupengaliya nndema waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">Kwa mbengale ya sapi ngani kuhuma kunani ni kiliba sa masi sekitulii pai.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Apengaliwa sukupata ilebi ya amboni kukubali lyoba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">kwi ilebi ya kila mwei.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Kwi ilebi yaamboni yi itombi ya pamwandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:15">ni ilebi yi itombi ya mwandi.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Nndema waki gutwelala goa gagabii gaamboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">gapengaliwa kwa uamboni waka Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">jojuwe japitila pi kioli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Mbengale heyi yahulukiya bandu bi likabila laka Josepu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">jojabii nkolongu kati ja alongu baki.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Josepu jubii na makili ngati likambaku la ng'ombi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">manyelu haga ndi makabila gaka Manase na makabila Efulaimu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Epulaimu jabiya na akomana ngondu baki elupu komi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">na akomana ngondu baka Manase babiya elupu komi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Ku likabila laka Zebuluni ni likabila laka Isakali, japwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">Zebuluni mahengu gabu gunzendila sapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">ni likabila li Isakali mahengu ginu gaajendila sapi mu mahema gii.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Baakema ageni mu itombi yabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na hoku bandu biipiya matambiku gagapalika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Ndaba bombi biipata mali gingi kuhuma kunhanga nkolongu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na hindu yeahihiki mu nsangi uku mbwani.<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Ku likabila laka Gadi, jaapwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">“Julumbalika Sapanga joampeke Gadi pandu pakolongu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Gadi juhepila ngati lihimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">jupata kuboku nu lutoto lu umutu.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Jahagula lieneu la sapi kupeta goti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">pandu pabahagulwi pandu piki kilongosi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Jaalongua bandu nukunzetakale bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">jajomuliya mpangu waka Sapanga kwa Aizilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Ku likabila laka Dani jaapwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dani ndi lihimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">lelihomba kuhuma ku Bashani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Ku likabila la Nafutali japwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">“ Mwaa Nafutali mwaamboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">ndaba gutweli mbengale yaka Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">nndema waku uku kusini mu nhanga uku Galilaya.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Ku likabila la Asheli japwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">“Asheli jupengaliwa kupeta bana boti baka Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">na alongu baku boti bampala ngamaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">nu nndema waki wibiya na mahuta gingi gi mizeituni.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Matanga ga misi jii giibia gikisoma na shaba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">Womi waku widumua kutama kwaku kwoti!”<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Musa jajomuliya ku kupwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">“Mwaa Izilaeli, ngakuba jojubii ngati Sapanga waku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">jombi jupeta kunani ku maundi kuhika kugujangati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">jupeta panani mu ulumbi waki gogubonikana.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Sapanga jwa yaka yanga na mwisu ndi pandu pinu pukutili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">makili gaki gabonikana pu nndema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">Jaabenga abaja palongi jinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">jaalagalakiya, ‘Mwaakoma boti.’<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Ndienu, bandu buku Izilaeli biitama sapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">ibeleku yaka Yakobu kajika jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">mu nndema gogutweli ilebi na divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">ndema goguwe iyula jikuna kuhuma kunani. <verse eid="DEU 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Ntogulia mwaa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Nya jojubii ngati mwanganya, mwabandu mojunhokwi mweni Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">jojuwe ndi ngau ju kujangatiwa witu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">nu upanga gunndete kuwesa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Abaja bitu biika kunzinamii palongi jinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">nanamu mwaakanyatiya pai.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Ndienu Musa jaboka kuubamba unndema uku Moabu, jajenda ku kitombi suku Nebu, jakwela ku lubekubeku luku Pisiga lolubii pambipi na Yeliku. Hapa ndi Bambu Sapanga anndangia nndema woti. Kuhuma ku Gileadi mbaka ku Dani, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />lieneu loti luku Nafutali, lieneu luku Efulaimu na Manasi, lieneu loti luku Yuda mbaka nhanga uku Meditelania, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />lungwenza luku Negebu ni lieneu luku ligomba luku Yeliku, musi uku Mitendi mbaka ku Soali. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Musa, “Gongo ndi nndema gola gonundagila Abulamu ni Isaka na Yakobu kubanga naapekiya ibeleku yabu. Nugulangii nndema gongo, lakini ngawihiki hoku.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Ndienu, Musa ntumisi waka Bambu Sapanga jakuwa ku nndema uku Moabu, ngati Bambu Sapanga ejabiya jupwagiki. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Bambu Sapanga anntaga. Anntaga mu ligomba luku Moabu, pambipi na musi uku Beti Peoli, lakini mbaka lelenu, ngakuba mundu jojumanyiki paantagiki. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Musa jabii na yaka mia jimu ni ishilini pajakuwa, mihu gaki gabiii gakona gabii na makili gukulinga. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Aizilaeli balobalakiya kuwa kwaki kwa masoba selasini mu nndema gupuubamba guku Moabu. Ndienu lisoba lukukanga luwai nukulobalake kwaki, gatenda kujomoka.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Joshua mwana waka Nuni jatweli loho ja malangu, kwa ndaba Musa jabiya ammbeki maboku. Ndienu Aizilaeli bunzetakiya Joshua nu kupwata malagalaki gaguge Bambu Sapanga jabiya ampeki Musa.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Tumbuka kipindi hesi ngasekupitii kabee mlota ku Izilaeli ngati Musa, jojuwe Bambu Sapanga jukubika julongee naku ngati mundu nu nkosi waki. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Ngakuba nndota jongi jojabiya juhenga nginyuli ngati yela yeyuye Bambu Sapanga antuma Musa juhenga kwaka bambu nkolongu juku Misili, na akolongu baki nu mu nndema gwaki gwoa. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Ngakuba nndota jongi jojuhengika majambu makolongu gukujogoo ngati ejabiya juhenga Musa palongi ja Aizilaeli boti.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>